#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:1751
msgid "<xref linkend=\"goscustdesk-TBL-86\"/> lists the audio feedback preferences that you can modify."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"goscustdesk-TBL-86\"/> ສະແດງລາຍການການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕອບສະໜອງດ້ວຍສຽງທີ່ທ່າ"
"ນສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:1753
msgid "Audio Feedback Preferences"
