#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2433
msgid "The <application>Sound</application> preference tool enables you to control devices and volume for sound input and output. You can also specify which sounds to play when particular events occur."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືປັບແຕ່ງ <application>ສຽງ</application> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄວບຄຸມອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ລະດັບສຽງທັງຂາ"
"ເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸສຽງທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ຫຼິ້ນເມື່ອເກີດເຫດການຕ່າງໆໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2436
msgid "You can customize the settings for the <application>Sound</application> preference tool in the following functional areas:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຽງໃນພາກສ່ວນຕ່າງໆດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2440
msgid "<guilabel>Sound Events</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ເຫດການສຽງ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2445
msgid "<guilabel>Input</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂາເຂົ້າ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2450
msgid "<guilabel>Output</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂາອອກ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2455
msgid "You can change the overall output volume using the <guilabel>Output volume</guilabel> slider at the top of the window. The <guilabel>Mute</guilabel> checkbox allows to temporarily suppress all output without disturbing the current volume."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນລະດັບສຽງຂາອອກທັງໝົດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນ <guilabel>ລະດັບສຽງຂາອອກ</guilabel>. "
"ຫ້ອງໝາຍຕິກ <guilabel>ປິດສຽງ</guilabel> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປິດສຽງຊົ່ວຄາວໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ກະທົບຄ່າລະດັບສຽງທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2457
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2460
msgid "Sound Effects Preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເອັບເຟັກສຽງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2458
msgid "A sound theme is collection of sound effects that are associated to various events, such as opening a dialog, clicking a button or selecting an item in a menu. One of the most prominent event sounds is the <emphasis>System Bell</emphasis> sound that is often played to indicate a keyboard input error. Use the <guilabel>Sound Effects</guilabel> tabbed section of the <application>Sound</application> preference tool to choose a sound theme and modify the bell sound."
msgstr ""
"ທີມສຽງແມ່ນການລວມເອົາເອັບເຟັກສຽງຕ່າງໆມາໃຊ້ກັບເຫດການ ເຊັ່ນ: ການເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງ, ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ. ສຽງທີ່ຄຸ້ນ"
"ເຄີຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນສຽງ \"ກະດິ່ງລະບົບ\" ທີ່ມັກດັງເມື່ອພິມຜິດ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2459
msgid "<xref linkend=\"goscustmulti-TBL-6\"/> lists the sound effects preferences that you can modify."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"goscustmulti-TBL-6\"/> ສະແດງລາຍການການຕັ້ງຄ່າເອັບເຟັກສຽງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້"
"ໄຂໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2477
msgid "<guilabel>Alert Volume</guilabel> slider"
msgstr "ແຖບເລື່ອນ <guilabel>ລະດັບສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2480
msgid "Use the <guilabel>Alert Volume</guilabel> slider to control the volume for event sounds."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນ <guilabel>ລະດັບສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນ</guilabel> ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄວາມດັງຂອງສຽງເຫດການຕ່າງໆ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2482
msgid "The <guilabel>Mute</guilabel> checkbox allows to temporarily suppress event sounds without modifying the current volume."
msgstr ""
"ຫ້ອງໝາຍຕິກ <guilabel>ປິດສຽງ</guilabel> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປິດສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນຊົ່ວຄາວໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2489
msgid "<guilabel>Sound Theme </guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ທີມສຽງ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2494
msgid "Use this combobox to select a different sound theme."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ກ່ອງລາຍການນີ້ເພື່ອເລືອກທີມສຽງອື່ນ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2495
msgid "Choose <guilabel>No sounds</guilabel> to turn off all event sounds."
msgstr "ເລືອກ <guilabel>ບໍ່ມີສຽງ</guilabel> ເພື່ອປິດສຽງເຫດການທັງໝົດ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2500
msgid "<guilabel>Choose an alert sound </guilabel> list"
msgstr "ລາຍການ <guilabel>ເລືອກສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2503
msgid "Choose an alternative sound for the System Bell from this list."
msgstr "ເລືອກສຽງອື່ນມາແທນສຽງກະດິ່ງລະບົບຈາກລາຍການນີ້."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2504
msgid "Selecting a list element plays the sound."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເລືອກລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງ, ລະບົບຈະຫຼິ້ນສຽງນັ້ນໃຫ້ຟັງ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2509
msgid "<guilabel>Enable window and button sounds </guilabel> checkbox"
msgstr "ຫ້ອງໝາຍຕິກ <guilabel>ເປີດໃຊ້ສຽງໜ້າຕ່າງ ແລະ ປຸ່ມ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2512
msgid "Uncheck this option if you don't want to hear sounds for window-related events (such as a dialog or a menu appearing) and button clicks."
msgstr ""
"ເອົາໝາຍຕິກອອກຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້ຍິນສຽງເມື່ອມີໜ້າຕ່າງປະກົດຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ເມື່ອຄລິກປຸ່ມ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2523
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2527
msgid "Sound Input Preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຽງຂາເຂົ້າ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2524
msgid "Use the <guilabel>Input</guilabel> tabbed section to set your preferences for sound input."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ແທັບ <guilabel>ຂາເຂົ້າ</guilabel> ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຽງຂາເຂົ້າ (ເຊັ່ນ ໄມໂຄຣໂຟນ)."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscustdesk.xml:2526
