msgid "A parent folder is the folder that contains the current folder. To display the contents of your current folder's parent, do one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີຫຼັກແມ່ນໂຟນເດີທີ່ບັນຈຸໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ. ເພື່ອສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້"
"ປະຕິບັດຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:305
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open Parent</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເປີດໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ</guimenuitem>"
"</menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:308
msgid "Press <keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>up arrow</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>ລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ</keycap></keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:310
msgid "Choose from the parent folder selector at the bottom left of the window."
msgstr "ເລືອກຈາກຕົວເລືອກໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:312
msgid "To close the current folder while opening the parent, hold down <keycap>Shift</keycap> while choosing from the parent folder selector, or press <keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>up arrow</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປິດໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ເປີດໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ, ໃຫ້ກົດ <keycap>Shift</keycap> ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລືອ"
"ກຈາກຕົວເລືອກໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ, ຫຼື ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap>"
"<keycap>ລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ</keycap></keycombo>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:315
msgid "Closing Folders"
msgstr "ການປິດໂຟນເດີ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:316
msgid "To close folders you may simply click on the close window button, this however may not be the most efficient way to close many windows. If you would like to view only the current folder, and not the folders you opened to reach the current folder, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Close Parent Folders</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. If want to close all folders on the screen, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Close All Folders</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປິດໂຟນເດີ ທ່ານອາດຈະພຽງແຕ່ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມປິດໜ້າຕ່າງ, ແຕ່ນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ສຸດໃນການປິດໜ້າຕ່"
"າງຫຼາຍໆອັນ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງພຽງແຕ່ໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂຟນເດີຕ່າງໆທີ່ທ່ານເປີດຜ່ານມາເພື່ອມາຫາໂ"
"ຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນນີ້, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</guimenu><guimenuitem>ປິດໂຟນເດີຫຼັກທັງ"
"ໝົດ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ຖ້າຕ້ອງການປິດໂຟນເດີທັງໝົດໃນໜ້າຈໍ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</guimenu><guimenuitem>ປິດໂຟນເດີທັງໝົດ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:321
msgid "Displaying a Folder in a Browser Window"
msgstr "ການສະແດງໂຟນເດີໃນໜ້າຕ່າງບຣາວເຊີ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:322
msgid "If you wish to display a single folder in browser mode, while otherwise continuing to work in spatial mode, perform the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະແດງໂຟນເດີດຽວໃນໂໝດບຣາວເຊີ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດສະເປຊຽວຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັ"
"ດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:325
msgid "Select a folder while in spatial mode."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂຟນເດີໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດສະເປຊຽວ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:328
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Browse Folder</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</guimenu><guimenuitem>ທ່ອງເບິ່ງໂຟນເດີ</guimenuitem>"
"</menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:333
msgid "Opening a Location"
msgstr "ການເປີດຕຳແໜ່ງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:334
msgid "You can open a folder or other location in spatial mode by typing its name."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໂຟນເດີ ຫຼື ຕຳແໜ່ງອື່ນໆໃນໂໝດສະເປຊຽວໄດ້ໂດຍການພິມຊື່ຂອງມັນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:335
msgid "Choose <menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo><keysym>L</keysym></keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open Location</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, and type the path or URI of the location you wish to open."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo><keysym>L</keysym></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ເປີດຕຳແໜ່ງ</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice>, ແລະ ພິມເສັ້ນທາງ ຫຼື URI ຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເປີດ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:347
msgid "Browser Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດບຣາວເຊີ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:352
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>windows</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ໜ້າຕ່າງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:356
msgid "The following section describes how to browse your system using the <application>Caja</application> file manager when configured in browser mode. In browser mode, opening a folder updates the current file manager to show the contents of the new folder."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການທ່ອງເບິ່ງລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ <application>Caja</"
"application> ເມື່ອຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໂໝດບຣາວເຊີ. ໃນໂໝດບຣາວເຊີ, ການເປີດໂຟນເດີຈະເປັນການອັບເດດຕົວຈັດກ"
"ານໄຟລ໌ປັດຈຸບັນເພື່ອສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂຟນເດີໃໝ່."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:359
msgid "The File Browser Window"
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:362
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Applications</guimenu><guimenuitem>System Tools</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>File Browser</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເຄື່ອງມືລະບົບ</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>ຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:363
msgid "While in spatial mode you may open a folder in browser mode by right clicking on that folder and choosing <guimenuitem>Browse Folder</guimenuitem>. A new file browser window will then open and display the contents of the selected folder."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດສະເປຊຽວ ທ່ານອາດຈະເປີດໂຟນເດີໃນໂໝດບຣາວເຊີໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ ແລະ ເ"
"ລືອກ <guimenuitem>ທ່ອງເບິ່ງໂຟນເດີ</guimenuitem>. ຈາກນັ້ນໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນ ແລ"
"ະ ສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂຟນເດີທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:364
msgid "If <application>Caja</application> is set to always open browser windows, double clicking any folder will open a browser window, see <xref linkend=\"goscaja-56\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າ <application>Caja</application> ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງບຣາວເຊີສະເໝີ, ການດັບເບິລຄລິກໂຟນ"
"ເດີໃດໜຶ່ງຈະເປັນການເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງບຣາວເຊີ, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"goscaja-56\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:360
msgid "You can access the file browser in the following ways: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີດັ່ງນີ້: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:366
msgid "Contents of a Folder in a File Browser Window"
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂຟນເດີໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/mediaobject
#: C/goscaja.xml:368
msgid "<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/caja_browser_mode.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> A folder in a file browser window.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/caja_browser_mode.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> ໂຟນເດີໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟ"
"ລ໌.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:379
msgid "In some distributions of the MATE Desktop, the <guibutton>Home</guibutton> toolbar button might have another designation, for example, <guibutton>Documents</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບາງຊຸດການແຈກຢາຍຂອງເດັສທັອບ MATE, ປຸ່ມແຖບເຄື່ອງມື <guibutton>ບ້ານ</guibutton> ອາດຈະມີຊື່"
"ອື່ນ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: <guibutton>ເອກະສານ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:382
msgid "The File Browser Window Components"
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:383
msgid "<xref linkend=\"goscaja-TBL-83\"/> describes the components of a file browser window."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"goscaja-TBL-83\"/> ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:385
msgid "File Browser Window Components"
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#. (itstool) path: term/interface
#. (itstool) path: para/interface
#: C/goscaja.xml:416
#: C/gostools.xml:378
#: C/gostools.xml:636
#: C/gostools.xml:660
#: C/gostools.xml:684
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:419
msgid "Contains buttons that you use to perform tasks in the file manager."
msgstr "ປະກອບດ້ວຍປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດວຽກງານໃນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:422
msgid "<guibutton>Back</guibutton> Returns to the previously visited location. The adjacent drop down list also contains a list of the most recently visited locations to allow you to return to them faster."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>ຍ້ອນກັບ</guibutton> ກັບຄືນໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເຄີຍເບິ່ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ລາຍຊື່ແບບດຣັອບດາວທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງໆ"
"ຍັງມີລາຍຊື່ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຫາກໍ່ເບິ່ງໄປເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານກັບຄືນໄປຫາພວກມັນໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:425
msgid "<guimenu>Forward</guimenu> Performs the opposite function to the <guibutton>Back</guibutton> toolbar item. If you have previously navigated back in time, then this button returns you to the present."
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>ໄປຂ້າງໜ້າ</guimenu> ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບປຸ່ມແຖບເຄື່ອງມື <guibutton>ຍ້ອນກັບ</"
"guibutton>. ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ຍ້ອນກັບໄປກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະພາທ່ານກັບຄືນມາຫາຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:428
msgid "<guibutton>Up</guibutton> Moves up one level to the parent of the current folder."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>ຂຶ້ນ</guibutton> ຍ້າຍຂຶ້ນໄປໜຶ່ງລະດັບຫາໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:431
msgid "<guibutton>Reload</guibutton> Refreshes the contents of the current folder."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>ໂຫຼດໃໝ່</guibutton> ເຮັດໃຫ້ເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນເປັນຄ່າຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:434
msgid "<guibutton>Home</guibutton> Opens your Home Folder."
msgstr "<guibutton>ບ້ານ</guibutton> ເປີດໂຟນເດີບ້ານຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:437
msgid "<guibutton>Computer</guibutton> Opens your Computer folder."
msgstr "<guibutton>ຄອມພິວເຕີ</guibutton> ເປີດໂຟນເດີຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:440
msgid "<guibutton>Search</guibutton> Opens the search bar."
msgstr "<guibutton>ຄົ້ນຫາ</guibutton> ເປີດແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:447
msgid "Location bar"
msgstr "ແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:450
msgid "The location bar is a very powerful tool for navigating your computer. It can appear in three different ways depending on your selection. For more on using the location bar see <xref linkend=\"caja-location-bar\"/>. In all three configurations the location bar always contains the following items."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍສຳລັບການນຳທາງໃນຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ. ມັນສາມາດປາກົດໄດ້ໃນສາມຮູ"
"ບແບບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບການເລືອກຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງ ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"caja-location-bar\"/>. ໃນທັງສາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງຈະມີລາຍການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະເໝີ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:453
msgid "<guimenu>Zoom</guimenu> buttons: Enables you to change the size of items in the view pane."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ <guimenu>ຊູມ</guimenu>: ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຂອງລາຍການໃນຊ່ອງມຸມມອງໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:457
msgid "<guilabel>View as</guilabel> drop-down list: Enables you to choose how to show items in your view pane."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ແບບດຣັອບດາວ <guilabel>ເບິ່ງເປັນ</guilabel>: ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກວິທີການສະແດງລາຍການ"
"ໃນຊ່ອງມຸມມອງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:466
msgid "Side pane"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:469
msgid "Performs the following functions:"
msgstr "ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:472
msgid "Shows information about the current file or folder."
msgstr "ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:475
msgid "Enables you to navigate through your files."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳທາງຜ່ານໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:478
msgid "To display the side pane, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Side Pane</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The side pane contains a drop-down list that enables you to choose what to show in the side pane. You can choose from the following options:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສະແດງຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງ, ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ຊ່ອງ"
"ເບື້ອງຂ້າງ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງຈະມີລາຍຊື່ແບບດຣັອບດາວທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກວ່"
"າຈະສະແດງຫຍັງໃນຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຈາກຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:483
msgid "<guilabel>Places</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ສະຖານທີ່</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:486
msgid "Displays places of particular interest."
msgstr "ສະແດງສະຖານທີ່ຕ່າງໆທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈເປັນພິເສດ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:489
msgid "<guilabel>Information</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂໍ້ມູນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:492
msgid "Displays the icon and information about the current folder. Buttons may appear in the side pane, these buttons enable you to perform actions on the current folder, other than the default action."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ. ອາດຈະມີປຸ່ມປາກົດຂຶ້ນໃນຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງ, ປຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານ"
"ສາມາດປະຕິບັດການຕ່າງໆກັບໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ ນອກເໜືອຈາກການປະຕິບັດການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:496
msgid "<guilabel>Tree</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:499
msgid "Displays a hierarchical representation of your file system. You can use the <guilabel>Tree</guilabel> to navigate through your files."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ <guilabel>ແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້</guilabel> ເພື່ອນຳທາງ"
"ຜ່ານໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:503
msgid "<guilabel>History</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ປະຫວັດ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:506
msgid "Contains a history list of files, folders, FTP sites, and URIs that you have recently visited."
msgstr ""
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ປະຫວັດຂອງໄຟລ໌, ໂຟນເດີ, ເວັບໄຊ FTP, ແລະ URI ທີ່ທ່ານຫາກໍ່ເບິ່ງໄປ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:510
msgid "<guilabel>Notes</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ບັນທຶກ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:513
msgid "Enables you to add notes to your files and folders."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມບັນທຶກໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:516
msgid "<guilabel>Emblems</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ສັນຍະລັກ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:519
msgid "Contains emblems that you can add to a file or folder."
msgstr "ປະກອບດ້ວຍສັນຍະລັກຕ່າງໆທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:522
msgid "To close the side pane, click on the <guibutton>X</guibutton> button at the top right of the side pane."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປິດຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>X</guibutton> ຢູ່ທາງເທິງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້"
"າງ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:566
msgid "Showing and Hiding File Browser Window Components"
msgstr "ການສະແດງ ແລະ ການຊ້ອນສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:567
#: C/goscaja.xml:594
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>window components, showing and hiding</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ສ່ວນປະກອບໜ້າຕ່າງ, ການສະແດງ ແລະ ການຊ້ອນ</"
"secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:572
msgid "To show or hide any of the components of the file browser described in <xref linkend=\"goscaja-TBL-83\"/> select any of the following items from the menu:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສະແດງ ຫຼື ຊ້ອນສ່ວນປະກອບໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໃນ <xref linkend=\"goscaja-"
"TBL-83\"/> ໃຫ້ເລືອກລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກເມນູ:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:575
msgid "To hide the side pane, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Side Pane</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. To display the side pane again, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Side Pane</guimenuitem></menuchoice> again. Alternatively you may press <keycap>F9</keycap> to toggle the visibility of the side pane."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຊ້ອນຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງ, ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ຊ່ອງເບື້"
"ອງຂ້າງ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ເພື່ອສະແດງຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງອີກຄັ້ງ, ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ອີກ"
"ຄັ້ງ. ຫຼື ທ່ານອາດຈະກົດ <keycap>F9</keycap> ເພື່ອເປີດ/ປິດການສະແດງຜົນຂອງຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂ້າງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:579
msgid "To hide the toolbar, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Main Toolbar</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. To display the toolbar again, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Main Toolbar</guimenuitem></menuchoice> again."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຊ້ອນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື, ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ແຖບເຄື່ອງ"
"ມືຫຼັກ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ເພື່ອສະແດງແຖບເຄື່ອງມືອີກຄັ້ງ, ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຫຼັກ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ອີກ"
"ຄັ້ງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:583
msgid "To hide the location bar, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Location Bar</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. To display the location bar again, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Location Bar</guimenuitem></menuchoice> again."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຊ້ອນແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງ, ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ແຖບຕຳແໜ່"
"ງ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ເພື່ອສະແດງແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງອີກຄັ້ງ, ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ອີກຄັ້"
"ງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:587
msgid "To hide the statusbar, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Statusbar</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. To display the statusbar again, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Statusbar</guimenuitem></menuchoice> again."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຊ້ອນແຖບສະຖານະ, ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ແຖບສະຖ"
"ານະ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ເພື່ອສະແດງແຖບສະຖານະອີກຄັ້ງ, ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ມຸມມອງ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ແຖບສະຖານະ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ອີກຄັ້"
"ງ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:593
msgid "Using the Location Bar"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:599
msgid "The file browser's location bar can show either a location field, a button bar, or a search field. Each is useful in different situations."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຕົວທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້ທັງຊ່ອງຕຳແໜ່ງ, ແຖບປຸ່ມ, ຫຼື ຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາ. ແຕ່ລະຢ່າງມີປະໂຫຍ"
"ດໃນສະຖານະການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:604
msgid "<guilabel>Button bar</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ແຖບປຸ່ມ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:605
msgid "By default the button bar is shown. This shows a row of buttons representing the current location's hierarchy, with a button for each containing folder. Click on the button to jump between folders in the hierarchy. You can return to the original folder, which is shown as the last button in the row."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແຖບປຸ່ມຈະຖືກສະແດງ. ນີ້ຈະສະແດງແຖວຂອງປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນ, "
"ໂດຍມີປຸ່ມສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂຟນເດີທີ່ບັນຈຸຢູ່. ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມເພື່ອຂ້າມໄປມາລະຫວ່າງໂຟນເດີຕ່າງໆໃນລຳດັບຊັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດກັ"
"ບຄືນໄປຫາໂຟນເດີເດີມໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເປັນປຸ່ມສຸດທ້າຍໃນແຖວ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
