#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1939
msgid "Select the file or folder that you want to move to <guilabel>Trash</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ <guilabel>ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1942
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Move to Trash</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Alternatively, right-click on the file or folder, then choose <guimenuitem>Move to Trash</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ຍ້າຍໄປຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ "
"<guimenuitem>ຍ້າຍໄປຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guimenuitem>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1946
msgid "Alternatively, you can drag the file or folder to the <guilabel>Trash</guilabel> object on the desktop."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລາກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີໄປໃສ່ <guilabel>ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel> ຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບໄ"
"ດ້."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1948
msgid "When you move a file or folder from a removable media to <guilabel>Trash</guilabel>, the file or folder is stored in a <guilabel>Trash</guilabel> location on the removable media. To remove the file or folder permanently from the removable media, you must empty <guilabel>Trash</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີຈາກສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້ໄປທີ່ <guilabel>ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel>, ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເ"
"ດີນັ້ນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ <guilabel>ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel> ຂອງສື່ນັ້ນ. ເພື່ອລຶບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີອອກຈາກສື່ນັ້ນ"
"ຢ່າງຖາວອນ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງຖິ້ມຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອໃນ <guilabel>ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel> ໃຫ້ໝົດ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:1954
msgid "Deleting a File or Folder"
msgstr "ການລຶບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:1955
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>deleting files or folders</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ການລຶບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1959
msgid "When you delete a file or folder, the file or folder is not moved to <guilabel>Trash</guilabel>, but is deleted from your file system immediately. The <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> menu item is only available if you select the <guilabel>Include a Delete command that bypasses Trash</guilabel> option in the <guilabel>File Management Preferences</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າລຶບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ <guilabel>ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel>, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈ"
"າກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງເຈົ້າທັນທີ. ລາຍການເມນູ <guimenuitem>ລຶບ</guimenuitem> ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລື"
"ອກຕົວເລືອກ <guilabel>ລວມຄຳສັ່ງລຶບທີ່ບໍ່ຜ່ານຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel> ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"
"ການຈັດການໄຟລ໌</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1965
msgid "To delete a file or folder perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1968
msgid "Select the file or folder that you want to delete."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1971
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Alternatively, right-click on the file or folder, then choose <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ລຶບ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ລຶບ</"
"guimenuitem>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1978
msgid "This shortcut is independent from the <guilabel>Include a Delete command that bypasses Trash</guilabel> option."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມລັດນີ້ແມ່ນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກຕົວເລືອກ <guilabel>ລວມຄຳສັ່ງລຶບທີ່ບໍ່ຜ່ານຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1975
msgid "Alternatively, select the file or folder you want to delete, and press <keycombo><keycap>Shift</keycap><keycap>Del</keycap></keycombo>. <_:note-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລຶບ, ແລ້ວກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Shift</"
"keycap><keycap>Del</keycap></keycombo>. <_:note-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:1984
msgid "Creating a Symbolic Link to a File or Folder"
msgstr "ການສ້າງລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:1988
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>creating symbolic link</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ການສ້າງລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:1992
msgid "<primary>symbolic link</primary> <secondary>to file or folder, creating</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ</primary> <secondary>ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ, ການສ້າງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:1996
msgid "A symbolic link is a special type of file that points to another file or folder. When you perform an action on a symbolic link, the action is performed on the file or folder to which the symbolic link points. However, when you delete a symbolic link, you delete the link file, not the file to which the symbolic link points."
msgstr ""
"ລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ປະເພດພິເສດທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີອື່ນ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າດຳເນີນການໃດໜຶ່ງໃສ່ລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ, ການ"
"ດຳເນີນການນັ້ນຈະມີຜົນກັບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ລິ້ງນັ້ນຊີ້ໄປຫາ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເມື່ອເຈົ້າລຶບລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ, ເຈົ້າພຽງແຕ່"
"ລຶບໄຟລ໌ລິ້ງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ລຶບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນທາງທີ່ລິ້ງນັ້ນຊີ້ໄປຫາ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2001
msgid "To create a symbolic link to a file or folder, select the file or folder to which you want to create a link. Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Make Link</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. A link to the file or folder is added to the current folder."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງລິ້ງ. ເລືອກ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ສ້າງລິ້ງ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. ລິ້ງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີນັ້ນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2004
msgid "Alternatively, grab the item to which you want to create a link, then press-and-hold <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Shift</keycap></keycombo>. Drag the item to the location where you want to place the link."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ຈັບລາຍການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງລິ້ງ, ແລ້ວກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap>"
"<keycap>Shift</keycap></keycombo> ຄ້າງໄວ້. ຈາກນັ້ນລາກລາຍການໄປທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການວາງລິ້"
"ງ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2007
msgid "By default, the file manager adds an emblem to symbolic links."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຈະເພີ່ມສັນຍະລັກໃສ່ລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2009
msgid "The permissions of a symbolic link are determined by the file or folder to which a symbolic link points."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດສິດຂອງລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ລິ້ງນັ້ນຊີ້ໄປຫາ."

