msgid "To hide a file or folder in <application>Caja</application>, either rename the file so its name begins with the period (.) character, or create a text file named <filename>.hidden</filename> in the same folder, and add its name to it, as in the example below:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີໃນ <application>Caja</application>, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນໃຫ້ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອ"
"ງໝາຍຈຸດ (.), ຫຼື ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມຊື່ວ່າ <filename>.hidden</filename> ໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີດຽວກັນ ແລ້ວເ"
"ພີ່ມຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອງລົງໄປ ດັ່ງຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: section/programlisting
#: C/goscaja.xml:2531
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"filename\n"
"foldername"
msgstr ""
"filename\n"
"foldername"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2533
msgid "You may need to refresh the relevant <application>Caja</application> window to see the change: press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>R</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງໂຫຼດໜ້າຕ່າງ <application>Caja</application> ນັ້ນໃໝ່ເພື່ອເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງ: ໂດຍກ"
"ານກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>R</keycap></keycombo>."

