#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2699
msgid "Changing the Icon for a File or Folder"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນໄອຄອນສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2701
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>icons</secondary> <tertiary>changing</tertiary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ໄອຄອນ</secondary> <tertiary>ການປ່ຽນແປ"
"ງ</tertiary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2706
msgid "To change the icon that represents an individual file or folder, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້ແທນແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2710
msgid "Select the file or folder that you want to change."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2716
msgid "On the <guilabel>Basic</guilabel> tabbed section, click on the current <guibutton>Icon</guibutton>. A <guilabel>Select custom icon</guilabel> dialog is displayed."
msgstr ""
"ໃນສ່ວນແທັບ <guilabel>ພື້ນຖານ</guilabel>, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ <guibutton>ໄອຄອນ</guibutton> ປັດຈຸ"
"ບັນ. ໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ເລືອກໄອຄອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ</guilabel> ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2721
msgid "Use the <guilabel>Select custom icon</guilabel> dialog to choose the icon to represent the file or folder."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ເລືອກໄອຄອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ</guilabel> ເພື່ອເລືອກໄອຄອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແທນໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເ"
"ດີນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2728
msgid "To restore an icon from a custom icon to the default icon, Select the file or folder that you want to change, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Click on the <guibutton>Icon</guibutton> button, in the <guilabel>select custom icon</guilabel> dialog click <guibutton>Revert</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄືນຄ່າໄອຄອນຈາກໄອຄອນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໃຫ້ເປັນໄອຄອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນ, ເລືອ"
"ກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</guimenu><guimenuitem>ຄຸນສົມບັດ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ໄອຄອນ</guibutton>, ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ເລືອກໄອຄອນ"
"ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ</guilabel> ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <guibutton>ຍ້ອນກັບ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2734
msgid "Adding an Emblem to a File or Folder"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມສັນຍະລັກໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2737
msgid "<primary>emblems</primary> <secondary>adding to file</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ສັນຍະລັກ</primary> <secondary>ການເພີ່ມໃສ່ໄຟລ໌</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2741
msgid "<primary>emblems</primary> <secondary>adding to folder</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ສັນຍະລັກ</primary> <secondary>ການເພີ່ມໃສ່ໂຟນເດີ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2745
msgid "To add an emblem to an item perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມສັນຍະລັກໃສ່ລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2748
msgid "Select the item to which you want to add an emblem."
msgstr "ເລືອກລາຍການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມສັນຍະລັກໃສ່."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2751
msgid "Right-click on the item, then choose <guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem>. The <xref linkend=\"caja-properties\"/> for the item is displayed."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ລາຍການນັ້ນ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ຄຸນສົມບັດ</guimenuitem>. <xref "
"linkend=\"caja-properties\"/> ຂອງລາຍການນັ້ນຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2754
msgid "Click on the <guilabel>Emblems</guilabel> tab to display the <guilabel>Emblems</guilabel> tabbed section."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ແທັບ <guilabel>ສັນຍະລັກ</guilabel> ເພື່ອສະແດງສ່ວນຂອງແທັບ <guilabel>ສັນຍະລັກ</"
"guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2757
msgid "Select the emblem to add to the item."
msgstr "ເລືອກສັນຍະລັກທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມໃສ່ລາຍການ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2763
msgid "In browser windows you may also add emblems to items by dragging them from the emblem side pane."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງບຣາວເຊີ ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມສັນຍະລັກໃສ່ລາຍການຕ່າງໆໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກພວກມັນມາຈາກແຖບຂ້າງສັນຍະລັ"
"ກ."

