#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2768
msgid "<primary>emblems</primary> <secondary>adding new</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ສັນຍະລັກ</primary> <secondary>ການເພີ່ມໃໝ່</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2772
msgid "To Create a new emblem, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງສັນຍະລັກໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2775
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Backgrounds and Emblems</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ພື້ນຫຼັງ ແລະ ສັນຍະລັກ</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2778
msgid "Click on the <guibutton>Emblem</guibutton> button, then click on the <guibutton>Add a New Emblem</guibutton> button. A <guilabel>Create a New Emblem</guilabel> dialog is displayed."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ສັນຍະລັກ</guibutton>, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເພີ່ມສັນຍະລັກໃໝ່</"
"guibutton>. ໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ສ້າງສັນຍະລັກໃໝ່</guilabel> ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2783
msgid "Type a name for the emblem in the <guilabel>Keyword</guilabel> text box."
msgstr "ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບສັນຍະລັກໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຄຳສຳຄັນ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2786
msgid "Click on the <guilabel>Image</guilabel> button. A dialog is displayed, click <guibutton>Browse</guibutton>. When you choose an emblem, click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ <guilabel>ຮູບພາບ</guilabel>. ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <guibutton>ຊອກຫາ</"
"guibutton>. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລືອກສັນຍະລັກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <guibutton>ຕົກລົງ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2791
msgid "Click <guibutton>OK</guibutton> on the <guilabel>Create a New Emblem</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ <guibutton>ຕົກລົງ</guibutton> ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ສ້າງສັນຍະລັກໃໝ່</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2797
msgid "Changing Backgrounds"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນພື້ນຫຼັງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2802
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>changing backgrounds</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ການປ່ຽນພື້ນຫຼັງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2806
msgid "<primary>backgrounds</primary> <secondary>changing screen component</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ພື້ນຫຼັງ</primary> <secondary>ການປ່ຽນອົງປະກອບໜ້າຈໍ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2810
msgid "The file manager includes background patterns and emblems that you can use to change the appearance of your folders. Background patterns and emblems can also be used on the desktop, on folders and certain side panes in the file browser, and on panels."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ມີລວດລາຍພື້ນຫຼັງ ແລະ ສັນຍະລັກທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງໂຟນເດີໄດ້. ລວດລາຍພື້ນ"
"ຫຼັງ ແລະ ສັນຍະລັກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບເດັສທັອບ, ໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ແຖບຂ້າງບາງສ່ວນໃນບຣາວເຊີໄຟລ໌, ລວມທັງໃ"
"ນແຖບພາເນລໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2814
msgid "To change the background of a window, pane, or panel, perform the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ, ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ ຫຼື ແຖບພາເນລ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2818
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Backgrounds and Emblems</guimenuitem></menuchoice> in any file manager window. The <guilabel>Backgrounds and Emblems</guilabel> dialog is displayed."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ພື້ນຫຼັງ ແລະ ສັນຍະລັກ</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງ. ໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ພື້ນຫຼັງ ແລະ ສັນຍ"
"ະລັກ</guilabel> ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2822
msgid "Click the <guibutton>Patterns</guibutton> button or the <guibutton>Colors</guibutton> button to see a list of background patterns or background colors you can use."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ລວດລາຍ</guibutton> ຫຼື ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ສີ</guibutton> ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍກ"
"ານລວດລາຍພື້ນຫຼັງ ຫຼື ສີພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2826
msgid "To change the background, drag a pattern or color to the desired window, pane, or panel. To reset the background, drag the <guilabel>Reset</guilabel> entry to the desired window, pane, or panel."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນພື້ນຫຼັງ, ໃຫ້ລາກລວດລາຍ ຫຼື ສີໄປທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງ, ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ ຫຼື ແຖບພາເນລທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ເພື່ອຄືນຄ່າພື້ນຫຼັ"
"ງ, ໃຫ້ລາກລາຍການ <guilabel>ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່</guilabel> ໄປທີ່ໜ້າຕ່າງ, ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ ຫຼື ແຖບພາເນລນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2832
msgid "You can set the background of all folders in the file manager by dragging a pattern or color with your right or middle mouse button. When you release the drag, you will see a popup menu with the option to set the pattern or color as the background for all folders."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງພື້ນຫຼັງໃຫ້ກັບທຸກໂຟນເດີໃນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກລວດລາຍ ຫຼື ສີ ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມຂວາ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມກາງຂອ"
"ງເມົາສ໌. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າປ່ອຍເມົາສ໌, ຈະມີເມນູປັອບອັບປາກົດຂຶ້ນພ້ອມກັບຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອຕັ້ງລວດລາຍ ຫຼື ສີນັ້ນເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັ"
"ບທຸກໂຟນເດີ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2836
msgid "You can add a new pattern to the list by clicking the <guibutton>Add a New Pattern</guibutton> button when the patterns are selected. Locate an image file in the file chooser dialog and click <guibutton>Open</guibutton>. The image file will appear in the list of patterns you can use."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມລວດລາຍໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເພີ່ມລວດລາຍໃໝ່</guibutton> "
"ເມື່ອເລືອກແທັບລວດລາຍຢູ່. ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວຄລິກ <guibutton>ເປີດ</"
"guibutton>. ໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບນັ້ນຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ລວດລາຍທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2840
msgid "You can add a new color to the list by clicking the <guibutton>Add a New Color</guibutton> button when the colors are selected. Select a color in the color chooser dialog and click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. The color will appear in the list of colors you can use."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມສີໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເພີ່ມສີໃໝ່</guibutton> ເມື່ອເລືອກແທັບ"
"ສີຢູ່. ເລືອກສີໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກສີແລ້ວຄລິກ <guibutton>ຕົກລົງ</guibutton>. ສີນັ້ນຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ສີທີ່ເຈົ້"
"າສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2847
msgid "Using Removable Media"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2851
msgid "<primary>removable media</primary> <secondary>introduction</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້</primary> <secondary>ບົດນຳ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2855
msgid "The file manager can initiate various actions when removable media appear, such as mounting it, opening a file manager window showing its contents, or running a suitable application that can handle it (for example a music player for an audio CD). See <xref linkend=\"goscaja-61\"/> for how to configure these actions for different media formats."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ສາມາດເລີ່ມການດຳເນີນການຕ່າງໆໄດ້ເມື່ອມີສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້ປາກົດຂຶ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ: ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສື່ "
"(mounting), ການເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອສະແດງເນື້ອໃນ, ຫຼື ການເປີດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເໝາະສົມເພື່ອຈັດ"
"ການສື່ນັ້ນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເປີດໂປຣແກຣມຫຼິ້ນເພງສຳລັບແຜ່ນຊີດີເພງ). ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"goscaja-"
"61\"/> ສຳລັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າການດຳເນີນການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບຮູບແບບສື່ຕ່າງໆ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2863
msgid "To Mount Media"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສື່ (Mount)"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2864
msgid "<primary>removable media</primary> <secondary>mounting</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້</primary> <secondary>ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mounting)</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2868
msgid "To <firstterm>mount</firstterm> media is to make the file system of the media available for access. When you mount media, the file system of the media is attached as a subdirectory to your file system."
msgstr ""
"ການ <firstterm>ເມົາທ໌</firstterm> (mount) ສື່ ຄືການເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງສື່ນັ້ນພ້ອມສຳລັບການເຂົ້າ"
"ເຖິງ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເມົາທ໌ສື່, ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງສື່ນັ້ນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຂົ້າເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2871
msgid "To mount media, insert the media in the appropriate device. An icon that represents the media is added to the desktop. The icon is added only if your system is configured to mount the device automatically when media is detected."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເມົາທ໌ສື່, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ສື່ນັ້ນເຂົ້າໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ໄອຄອນທີ່ແທນສື່ນັ້ນຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບ. ໄອຄອນຈະປ"
"າກົດຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເມົາທ໌ອຸປະກອນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການກວດພົບສື່."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2875
msgid "If your system is not configured to mount the device automatically, you must mount the device manually. Double-click on the <guilabel>Computer</guilabel> icon from the desktop. A <guilabel>Computer</guilabel> dialog is displayed. Double-click on the icon that represents the media. For example, to mount a floppy diskette, double-click on the <guilabel>Floppy</guilabel> icon. An icon that represents the media is added to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເມົາທ໌ອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງເມົາທ໌ອຸປະກອນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ໃຫ້ດັບເບິລຄລິກໃ"
"ສ່ໄອຄອນ <guilabel>ຄອມພິວເຕີ</guilabel> ຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບ. ໜ້າຕ່າງ <guilabel>ຄອມພິວເຕີ</"
"guilabel> ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ດັບເບິລຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນທີ່ແທນສື່ນັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອເມົາທ໌ແຜ່ນຟລັອບປີດິສ "
"(floppy disk), ໃຫ້ດັບເບິລຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນ <guilabel>Floppy</guilabel>. ໄອຄອນທີ່ແທນສື່ນັ້ນຈະປ"
"າກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2881
msgid "You cannot change the name of a removable media icon."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ໄອຄອນຂອງສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2885
msgid "To Display Media Contents"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງສື່"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2886
msgid "<primary>removable media</primary> <secondary>displaying media contents</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້</primary> <secondary>ການສະແດງເນື້ອໃນສື່</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2890
msgid "You can display media contents in any of the following ways:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງສື່ໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2893
msgid "Double-click on the icon that represents the media on the desktop."
msgstr "ດັບເບິລຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນທີ່ແທນສື່ນັ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2896
msgid "Right-click on the icon that represents the media on the desktop, then choose <guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄອຄອນທີ່ແທນສື່ນັ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ເປີດ</guimenuitem>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2900
msgid "A file manager window displays the contents of the media. To reload the display, click on the <guibutton>Reload</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຈະສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງສື່ນັ້ນ. ເພື່ອໂຫຼດການສະແດງຜົນໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ໂຫຼ"
"ດໃໝ່</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2904
msgid "To Display Media Properties"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສະແດງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງສື່"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2905
msgid "<primary>removable media</primary> <secondary>displaying media properties</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້</primary> <secondary>ການສະແດງຄຸນສົມບັດສື່</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2909
msgid "To display the properties of removable media, right-click on the icon that represents the media on the desktop, then choose <guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem>. A dialog displays the properties of the media."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສະແດງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄອຄອນທີ່ແທນສື່ນັ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ "
"<guimenuitem>ຄຸນສົມບັດ</guimenuitem>. ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະສະແດງຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆຂອງສື່ນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2911
msgid "To close the properties dialog, click <guibutton>Close</guibutton>."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດໜ້າຕ່າງຄຸນສົມບັດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <guibutton>ປິດ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2914
msgid "To Eject Media"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເອົາສື່ອອກ (Eject)"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2915
msgid "<primary>removable media</primary> <secondary>ejecting</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້</primary> <secondary>ການເອົາອອກ (ejecting)</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2919
msgid "To eject media, right-click on the media icon on the desktop, then choose <guimenuitem>Eject</guimenuitem>. If the drive for the media is a motorized drive, the media is ejected from the drive. If the drive for the media is not motorized, wait until the desktop icon for the media disappears, then eject the media manually."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເອົາສື່ອອກ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄອຄອນສື່ຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ເອົາອອກ</"
"guimenuitem>. ຫາກໄດຣຟ໌ (drive) ຂອງສື່ນັ້ນເປັນແບບລະບົບໄຟຟ້າ, ສື່ຈະຖືກດັນອອກມາຈາກໄດຣຟ໌. ຫາກໄ"
"ດຣຟ໌ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບໄຟຟ້າ, ໃຫ້ລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າໄອຄອນສື່ຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບຈະຫາຍໄປ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເອົາສື່ອອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2924
msgid "You cannot eject media from a motorized drive when the media is mounted. To eject media, first unmount the media. For example, to remove a USB flash drive, perform the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າບໍ່ສາມາດເອົາສື່ອອກຈາກໄດຣຟ໌ແບບໄຟຟ້າໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສື່ນັ້ນຍັງເມົາທ໌ (mounted) ຢູ່. ເພື່ອເອົາສື່ອອກ, ກ່ອນ"
"ອື່ນເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຍົກເລີກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສື່ (unmount) ກ່ອນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອເອົາ USB ແຟລັດໄດຣຟ໌ອອກ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມ"
"ຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2928
msgid "Close all file manager windows, <application>Terminal</application> windows, and any other windows that access the USB drive."
msgstr ""
"ປິດໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດ, ໜ້າຕ່າງ <application>Terminal</application>, ແລະ ໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນ"
"ໆທີ່ກຳລັງເຂົ້າເຖິງ USB ໄດຣຟ໌ນັ້ນຢູ່."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2932
msgid "Right-click on the icon that represents the drive on the desktop, then choose <guimenuitem>Eject</guimenuitem>. The desktop icon for the drive disappears."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄອຄອນທີ່ແທນໄດຣຟ໌ນັ້ນຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ເອົາອອກ</guimenuitem>"
". ໄອຄອນໄດຣຟ໌ຢູ່ເທິງເດັສທັອບຈະຫາຍໄປ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2937
msgid "Remove the USB flash drive."
msgstr "ຖອດ USB ແຟລັດໄດຣຟ໌ອອກ."

#. (itstool) path: caution/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2941
msgid "You must unmount removable media before ejecting. Do not remove a USB flash drive before you unmount the flash drive. If you do not unmount the media first you might lose data."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຍົກເລີກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສື່ (unmount) ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເອົາສື່ອອກ. ຫ້າມຖອດ USB ແຟລັດໄດຣຟ໌ອອກກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັນເ"
"ມົາທ໌ (unmount). ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ອັນເມົາທ໌ສື່ກ່ອນ ເຈົ້າອາດຈະສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2946
msgid "Writing CDs or DVDs"
msgstr "ການຂຽນແຜ່ນຊີດີ (CD) ຫຼື ດີວີດີ (DVD)"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2950
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>writing CDs</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ການຂຽນແຜ່ນຊີດີ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2954
msgid "<primary>CDs, writing</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>ຊີດີ, ການຂຽນ</primary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2957
msgid "<primary>writing CDs</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>ການຂຽນແຜ່ນຊີດີ</primary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:2960
msgid "<primary>burning CDs</primary> <see>writing CDs</see>"
msgstr "<primary>ການເບີນແຜ່ນຊີດີ</primary> <see>writing CDs</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2964
msgid "Writing to a CD or DVD may be useful for backing up your important documents. To do this, your computer must have a CD or DVD writer."
msgstr ""
"ການຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນ CD ຫຼື DVD ອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນເອກະສານທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງທ່ານ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງ"
"ນີ້, ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງມີເຄື່ອງຂຽນ CD ຫຼື DVD."

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2966
msgid "A simple way to check what sort of CD or DVD drive your computer has is to choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Places</guimenu><guimenuitem>Computer</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the top panel menubar. If the icon for your CD drive has terms like \"CD-RW\" or \"DVD(+-)R\" in its label, then your computer is able to write discs."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີງ່າຍໆໃນການກວດສອບວ່າຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານມີໄດຣຟ໌ CD ຫຼື DVD ປະເພດໃດແມ່ນໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ສະຖານທີ່</guimenu><guimenuitem>ຄອມພິວເຕີ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ຈາກແ"
"ຖບເມນູເທິງແຜງ. ຖ້າໄອຄອນສຳລັບໄດຣຟ໌ CD ຂອງທ່ານມີຄຳສັບເຊັ່ນ \"CD-RW\" ຫຼື \"DVD(+-)R\" ຢູ່ໃນປ້າ"
"ຍຊື່ຂອງມັນ, ສະແດງວ່າຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນແຜ່ນໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2968
msgid "You can start choosing files to burn to a disc at any time. The file manager provides a special folder for files and folders that you wish to write to a CD or DVD. From there you can easily write all the content (which you place in this special folder) to a CD or DVD."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມເລືອກໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ. ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ມີໂຟນເດີພິເສດສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນໃສ່ CD ຫຼື DVD. ຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນເນື້ອໃນທັງໝົດ (ທີ່ທ່ານວາງໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີພິເສດ"
"ນີ້) ໃສ່ CD ຫຼື DVD ໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:2971
msgid "Creating Data Discs"
msgstr "ການສ້າງແຜ່ນຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2973
msgid "To write a CD or DVD, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຂຽນ CD ຫຼື DVD, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2976
msgid "Open <menuchoice><guimenu>Applications</guimenu><guimenu>System Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>CD/DVD Creator</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The file manager opens the CD/DVD Creator folder."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guimenu><guimenu>ເຄື່ອງມືລະບົບ</guimenu>"
"<guimenuitem>ຕົວສ້າງ CD/DVD</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຈະເປີດໂຟນເດີຕົວສ້"
"າງ CD/DVD."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2977
msgid "In a File Browser window, the <guimenuitem>CD/DVD Creator</guimenuitem> item is available in the <guimenu>Go</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວທ່ອງໄຟລ໌, ລາຍການ <guimenuitem>ຕົວສ້າງ CD/DVD</guimenuitem> ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນເມນູ "
"<guimenu>ໄປ</guimenu>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2980
msgid "Drag the files and folders that you want to write to CD or DVD to the CD/DVD Creator folder."
msgstr ""
"ລາກໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນໃສ່ CD ຫຼື DVD ໄປທີ່ໂຟນເດີຕົວສ້າງ CD/DVD."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2984
msgid "Insert a writable CD or DVD into the CD/DVD writer device on your system."
msgstr "ໃສ່ແຜ່ນ CD ຫຼື DVD ທີ່ສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້ລົງໃນເຄື່ອງຂຽນ CD/DVD ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2987
msgid "Press the <guibutton>Write to Disc</guibutton> button, or choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Write to CD/DVD</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. A <guilabel>Write to Disc</guilabel> dialog is displayed."
msgstr ""
"ກົດປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນ</guibutton>, ຫຼື ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>ຂຽນໃສ່ CD/DVD</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ "
"<guilabel>ຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນ</guilabel> ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:2990
msgid "Use the <guilabel>Write to Disc</guilabel> dialog to specify how you want to write the CD, as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນ</guilabel> ເພື່ອລະບຸວິທີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນ CD ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3009
msgid "<guilabel>Write disc to</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂຽນແຜ່ນໄປທີ່</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3014
msgid "Select the device to which you want to write the CD from the drop-down list. To create an CD image file, select the <guilabel>File image</guilabel> option. A CD image file is a normal file that contains all the data in the same format as a CD, that you can write to a CD later."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກອຸປະກອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນ CD ຈາກລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງ. ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈ CD, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອ"
"ກ <guilabel>ໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈ</guilabel>. ໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈ CD ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ປົກກະຕິທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນ"
"ກັບ CD, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນໃສ່ CD ໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3020
msgid "<guilabel>Disc name</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຊື່ແຜ່ນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3025
msgid "Type a name for the CD in the text box."
msgstr "ພິມຊື່ສຳລັບ CD ລົງໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3030
msgid "<guilabel>Data size</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂະໜາດຂໍ້ມູນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3035
msgid "Shows the size of the data to be written to disc. The blank disk must be at least this size."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຂະໜາດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນ. ແຜ່ນເປົ່າຕ້ອງມີຂະໜາດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍເທົ່າກັບຂະໜາດນີ້."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3041
msgid "<guilabel>Write speed</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຄວາມໄວໃນການຂຽນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3046
msgid "Select the speed at which you want to write the CD from the drop-down list."
msgstr "ເລືອກຄວາມໄວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນ CD ຈາກລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3055
msgid "Click on the <guibutton>Write</guibutton> button."
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ຂຽນ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3056
msgid "If you selected the <guilabel>File image</guilabel> option from the <guilabel>Target to write to</guilabel> drop-down list, a <guilabel>Choose a filename for the disc image</guilabel> dialog is displayed. Use the dialog to specify the location where you want to save the disc image file. By default, disc image files have a <filename>.iso</filename> file extension."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ <guilabel>ໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈ</guilabel> ຈາກລາຍການ <guilabel>ເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຈະຂຽ"
"ນໃສ່</guilabel>, ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ເລືອກຊື່ໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບອິມເມຈແຜ່ນ</guilabel> ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມ"
"າ. ໃຊ້ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອລະບຸບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈແຜ່ນ. ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ, ໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈແຜ່ນຈະມີນ"
"າມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ເປັນ <filename>.iso</filename>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3060
msgid "A <guilabel>Writing disc</guilabel> dialog is displayed. This process takes some time. When the disc is written or when the disc image file is created, a message to indicate that the process is complete is displayed in the dialog."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ກຳລັງຂຽນແຜ່ນ</guilabel> ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ໃຊ້ເວລາໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ. "
"ເມື່ອຂຽນແຜ່ນສຳເລັດ ຫຼື ເມື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈແຜ່ນແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງວ່າຂະບວນການສຳເລັດແລ້ວຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນ"
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3065
msgid "You can set the CD/DVD Creator folder to open automatically when you insert a blank disc. See <xref linkend=\"goscaja-61\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໂຟນເດີຕົວສ້າງ CD/DVD ເປີດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານໃສ່ແຜ່ນເປົ່າ. ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"goscaja-61\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3066
msgid "The filesystem written to the CD will be readable with long filenames on all recent operating systems. Both the Joliet and the Rock Ridge CD-ROM filesystem extensions are used."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຂຽນໃສ່ CD ຈະສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ດ້ວຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຍາວໃນທຸກລະບົບປະຕິບັດການປັດຈຸບັນ. ໃຊ້ທັງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍລ"
"ະບົບໄຟລ໌ CD-ROM ແບບ Joliet ແລະ Rock Ridge."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3069
msgid "Copying CDs or DVDs"
msgstr "ການສຳເນົາ CD ຫຼື DVD"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3070
msgid "You can create a copy of a CD or DVD, either to another disc or to an image file stored on your computer. To create a copy, perform the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງ CD ຫຼື DVD ໄດ້, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນອື່ນ ຫຼື ເປັນໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຄ"
"ອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ. ເພື່ອສ້າງສຳເນົາ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3072
msgid "Insert the disc you want to copy."
msgstr "ໃສ່ແຜ່ນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳເນົາ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3073
msgid "Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Places</guimenu><guimenuitem>Computer</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the top panel menubar."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ສະຖານທີ່</guimenu><guimenuitem>ຄອມພິວເຕີ</guimenuitem>"
"</menuchoice> ຈາກແຖບເມນູແຜງເທິງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3074
msgid "Right-click on the CD icon, and choose <guimenuitem>Copy Disc</guimenuitem>."
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄອຄອນ CD, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ສຳເນົາແຜ່ນ</guimenuitem>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3075
msgid "The <guilabel>Write to Disc</guilabel> dialog is displayed."
msgstr "ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນ</guilabel> ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3077
msgid "If you have only one drive with write capabilities, the process will first create a disc image file on your computer. It will then eject the original disk, and ask you to change it for a blank disk on which to write the copy."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານມີໄດຣຟ໌ດຽວທີ່ສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້, ຂະບວນການຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈແຜ່ນໄວ້ໃນຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານກ່ອນ. ຫຼັງຈາກ"
"ນັ້ນມັນຈະເອົາແຜ່ນຕົ້ນສະບັບອອກ, ແລະ ຂໍໃຫ້ທ່ານປ່ຽນເປັນແຜ່ນເປົ່າເພື່ອຂຽນສຳເນົາລົງໄປ."

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3078
msgid "If you want to create more than one copy, choose the Image File option on the <guilabel>Write to Disc</guilabel> and then write the disc image: see <xref linkend=\"caja-cdwriter-writeimage\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງສຳເນົາ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ ໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈ ໃນ <guilabel>ຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນ</"
"guilabel> ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຂຽນອິມເມຈແຜ່ນ: ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"caja-cdwriter-writeimage\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3081
msgid "Creating a Disc from an Image File"
msgstr "ການສ້າງແຜ່ນຈາກໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3082
msgid "You can write a disc image to a CD or DVD. For example, you may have downloaded a disc image from the internet, or previously created one yourself. Disc images usually have a <filename>.iso</filename> file extension and are sometimes called iso files."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນອິມເມຈແຜ່ນໃສ່ CD ຫຼື DVD ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະດາວໂຫຼດອິມເມຈແຜ່ນມາຈາກອິນເຕີເນັ"
"ດ, ຫຼື ເຄີຍສ້າງມັນໄວ້ກ່ອນດ້ວຍຕົວເອງ. ອິມເມຈແຜ່ນມັກຈະມີນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ເປັນ <filename>.iso</"
"filename> ແລະ ບາງຄັ້ງກໍເອີ້ນວ່າ ໄຟລ໌ iso."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3083
msgid "To write a disc image, right-click on the disc image file, then choose <guimenuitem>Write to Disc</guimenuitem> from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຂຽນອິມເມຈແຜ່ນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ອິມເມຈແຜ່ນ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ຂຽນໃສ່ແຜ່ນ</"
"guimenuitem> ຈາກເມນູປ໊ອບອັບ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3087
msgid "Navigating Remote Servers"
msgstr "ການນຳທາງເຊີເວີທາງໄກ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3088
msgid "The <application>Caja</application> file manager provides an integrated access point to your files, applications, FTP sites, Windows shares, WebDav servers and SSH servers."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ <application>Caja</application> ມີຈຸດເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ປະສົມປະສານສຳລັບໄຟລ໌, ແອັບພລິເ"
"ຄຊັນ, ເວັບໄຊ FTP, ແຊຣ໌ຂອງ Windows, ເຊີເວີ WebDav ແລະ ເຊີເວີ SSH ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3091
msgid "To Access a remote server"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີທາງໄກ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3098
msgid "<primary>FTP sites</primary> <secondary>accessing</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ເວັບໄຊ FTP</primary> <secondary>ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3102
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>FTP sites</secondary> <see>FTP sites</see>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ເວັບໄຊ FTP</secondary> <see>ເວັບໄຊ "
"FTP</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3107
msgid "You can use the file manager to access a remote server, be it an FTP site, a Windows share, a WebDav server or an SSH server."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີທາງໄກ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນເວັບໄຊ FTP, ແຊຣ໌ຂອງ Windows, ເຊີ"
"ເວີ WebDav ຫຼື ເຊີເວີ SSH."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3109
msgid "To access a remote server, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Connect to Server</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. You may also access this dialog from the menubar by choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>Places</guimenu><guimenuitem>Connect to Server</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີທາງໄກ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເຊື່ອ"
"ມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ໄດ້ຈາກແຖບເມນູໂດຍກ"
"ານເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ສະຖານທີ່</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3111
msgid "To connect to a remote server, start by choosing the service type, then enter the server address."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີທາງໄກ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການເລືອກປະເພດການບໍລິການ, ແລ້ວໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3112
msgid "If required by your server, you may provide the following optional information:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນເສີມດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3130
msgid "<guilabel>Port</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ພອດ (Port)</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3135
msgid "Port to connect to on the server. This should only be used if it is necessary to change the default port, you would normally leave this blank."
msgstr ""
"ພອດສຳລັບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນພອດມາດຕະຖານເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິທ່າ"
"ນຄວນປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3141
msgid "<guilabel>Folder</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ໂຟນເດີ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3146
msgid "Folder to open upon connecting to server."
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີທີ່ຈະເປີດເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3151
msgid "<guilabel>User Name</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3156
msgid "The user name of the account used to connect to the server. This should be supplied with the connection information if needed. The user name information is not appropriate for a public FTP connection."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງບັນຊີທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນຖືກລະບຸພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ. ຂໍ້ມູນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ເ"
"ໝາະສົມສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ FTP ແບບສາທາລະນະ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3163
msgid "<guilabel>Name to use for connection</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຊື່ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3168
msgid "The designation of the connection as it will appear in the file manager."
msgstr "ຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3173
msgid "<guilabel>Share</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ແຊຣ໌ (Share)</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3178
msgid "Name of desired windows share. This is only applicable to Windows shares."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຂອງແຊຣ໌ Windows ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບແຊຣ໌ຂອງ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3183
msgid "<guilabel>Domain name</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຊື່ໂດເມນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3188
msgid "Windows domain. This is only applicable to Windows shares."
msgstr "ໂດເມນ Windows. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບແຊຣ໌ຂອງ Windows ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3194
msgid "If the server information is provided in the form of a URI, or you require a specialized connection, choose <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Custom Location</guimenuitem></menuchoice> as the service type."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ມູນເຊີເວີຖືກລະບຸໃນຮູບແບບ URI, ຫຼື ທ່ານຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບພິເສດ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenuitem>ກຳນົດສະຖານທີ່ເອງ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ເປັນປະເພດການບໍລິການ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3195
msgid "Once you have filled in the information, click on the <guibutton>Connect</guibutton> button. When the connection succeeds, the contents of the site are displayed and you may drag and drop files to and from the remote server."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່</guibutton>. ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳເລັດ, ເນື້ອ"
"ໃນຂອງເວັບໄຊຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດລາກ ແລະ ວາງໄຟລ໌ໄປຫາ ຫຼື ມາຈາກເຊີເວີທາງໄກໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3199
msgid "To Access Network Places"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3206
msgid "<primary>network places</primary> <secondary>accessing</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ສະຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ</primary> <secondary>ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3210
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>network places</secondary> <see>network places</see>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ສະຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ</secondary> <see>ສະຖານທີ່"
"ເຄືອຂ່າຍ</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3215
msgid "If your system is configured to access places on a network, you can use the file manager to access the network places."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າລະບົບຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ຕ່າງໆໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງສະ"
"ຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3218
msgid "To access network places, open the file manager and choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Places</guimenu><guimenuitem>Network Servers</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. A window opens that displays the network places that you can access. Double-click on the network that you want to access."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເປີດຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ສະຖານທີ່</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>ເຊີເວີເຄືອຂ່າຍ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ໜ້າຕ່າງຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອ"
"ສະແດງສະຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້. ຄລິກສອງບາດໃສ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

#. (itstool) path: para/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3220
msgid "<primary>NFS servers</primary><see>Unix network</see>"
msgstr "<primary>ເຊີເວີ NFS</primary><see>ເຄືອຂ່າຍ Unix</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3220
msgid "<_:indexterm-1/>To access UNIX shares, double-click on the <guilabel>Unix Network (NFS)</guilabel> object. A list of the UNIX shares available to you is displayed in the file manager window."
msgstr ""
"<_:indexterm-1/>ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງແຊຣ໌ UNIX, ໃຫ້ຄລິກສອງບາດໃສ່ວັດຖຸ <guilabel>ເຄືອຂ່າຍ Unix "
"(NFS)</guilabel>. ລາຍການແຊຣ໌ UNIX ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ທ່ານຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: para/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3224
msgid "<primary>Samba servers</primary><see>Windows network</see>"
msgstr "<primary>ເຊີເວີ Samba</primary><see>ເຄືອຂ່າຍ Windows</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3224
msgid "<_:indexterm-1/>To access Windows shares, double-click on the <guilabel>Windows Network (SMB)</guilabel> object. A list of the Windows shares available to you is displayed in the file manager window."
msgstr ""
"<_:indexterm-1/>ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງແຊຣ໌ Windows, ໃຫ້ຄລິກສອງບາດໃສ່ວັດຖຸ <guilabel>ເຄືອຂ່າຍ "
"Windows (SMB)</guilabel>. ລາຍການແຊຣ໌ Windows ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ທ່ານຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຈັດການໄຟ"
"ລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3230
msgid "Accessing Special URI Locations"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ URI ພິເສດ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3231
msgid "<primary>special URI locations</primary> <secondary>accessing</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ສະຖານທີ່ URI ພິເສດ</primary> <secondary>ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3235
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>special URI locations</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ສະຖານທີ່ URI ພິເສດ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3239
msgid "<primary>URI, special</primary> <see>special URI locations</see>"
msgstr "<primary>URI, ພິເສດ</primary> <see>ສະຖານທີ່ URI ພິເສດ</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3243
msgid "Caja has certain special URI locations that enable you to access particular functions from the file manager."
msgstr ""
"Caja ມີສະຖານທີ່ URI ພິເສດບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຟັງຊັນສະເພາະຕ່າງໆຈາກຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3244
msgid "These are intended for advanced users: in most cases, an easier method of accessing the function or location exists."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງ: ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ມັກຈະມີວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງຟັງຊັນ ຫຼື ສະຖານທີ່ນັ້"
"ນໆ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3245
msgid "<xref linkend=\"goscaja-TBL-479\"/> lists the special URI locations that you can use with the file manager."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"goscaja-TBL-479\"/> ສະແດງລາຍການສະຖານທີ່ URI ພິເສດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບຕົວ"
"ຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3247
msgid "Special URI Locations"
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່ URI ພິເສດ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3254
msgid "URI Location"
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່ URI"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3264
msgid "<command>burn:///</command>"
msgstr "<command>burn:///</command>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3269
msgid "This is a special location where you can copy files and folders that you want to write to a CD. From here you can write the contents of the location to a CD easily. See also <xref linkend=\"caja-cdwriter\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສະຖານທີ່ພິເສດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂຽນໃສ່ CD. ຈາກບ່ອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດຂ"
"ຽນເນື້ອໃນຂອງສະຖານທີ່ນີ້ໃສ່ CD ໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ. ເບິ່ງຕື່ມທີ່ <xref linkend=\"caja-cdwriter\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3275
msgid "<command>network:///</command>"
msgstr "<command>network:///</command>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3280
msgid "Displays network locations to which you can connect, if your system is configured to access locations on a network. To access a network location, double-click on the network location. You can also use this URI to add network locations to your system. See also <xref linkend=\"caja-accessnetwork\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງສະຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້, ຖ້າລະບົບຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ຕ່າງໆໃນເຄືອຂ່"
"າຍ. ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກສອງບາດໃສ່ສະຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍນັ້ນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ URI ນີ້ເພື່ອ"
"ເພີ່ມສະຖານທີ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ. ເບິ່ງຕື່ມທີ່ <xref linkend=\"caja-accessnetwork\"/>"
"."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3293
msgid "Caja Preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Caja"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3301
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>customizing</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ການປັບແຕ່ງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3305
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>preferences</secondary> <tertiary>introduction</tertiary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</secondary> <tertiary>ບົດນຳ</"
"tertiary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3310
msgid "<primary>preferences, file manager</primary> <see>file manager preferences</see>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <see>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3314
msgid "Use the <guilabel>File Management Preferences</guilabel> dialog to customize the file manager to suit your requirements and preferences."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຈັດການໄຟລ໌</guilabel> ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ"
"ກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຄວາມມັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3316
msgid "To display the <guilabel>File Management Preferences</guilabel> dialog, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Preferences</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. You can also access this dialog directly from the top panel Menubar by choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>System</guimenu><guisubmenu>Preferences</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>File Management</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຈັດການໄຟລ໌</guilabel>, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ທ່ານຍັງ"
"ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກແຖບເມນູແຜງເທິງໂດຍການເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ລະບົ"
"ບ</guimenu><guisubmenu>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>ການຈັດການໄຟລ໌</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3318
msgid "You can set preferences in the following categories:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໝວດໝູ່ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3321
msgid "The default settings for views."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບມຸມມອງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3324
msgid "The behavior of files and folders, executable text files, and Trash."
msgstr ""
"ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີ, ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສາມາດສັ່ງການໄດ້, ແລະ ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3327
msgid "The information that is displayed in icon captions and the date format."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຄຳອະທິບາຍໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຮູບແບບວັນທີ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3330
msgid "The columns that appear in the list view and their order."
msgstr "ຄໍລຳທີ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃນມຸມມອງລາຍການ ແລະ ລຳດັບຂອງພວກມັນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3333
msgid "Preview options to improve the performance of the file manager."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3336
msgid "How removable media and connected devices are handled."
msgstr "ວິທີການຈັດການສື່ທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3340
#: C/goscaja.xml:3354
msgid "Views Preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມມອງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3341
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>preferences</secondary> <tertiary>views</tertiary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</secondary> <tertiary>ມຸມມອ"
"ງ</tertiary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3346
msgid "You can specify a default view, and select sort options and display options. You can also specify default settings for icon views and list views."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸມຸມມອງມາດຕະຖານ, ແລະ ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກການຈັດລຳດັບ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກການສະແດງຜົນ. ທ່ານຍັງ"
"ສາມາດລະບຸການຕັ້ງຄ່າມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບມຸມມອງໄອຄອນ ແລະ ມຸມມອງລາຍການ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3349
msgid "To specify your default view settings, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Preferences</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Click on the <guilabel>Views</guilabel> tab to display the <guilabel>Views</guilabel> tabbed section."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລະບຸການຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມມອງມາດຕະຖານຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu>"
"<guimenuitem>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ຄລິກໃສ່ແທັບ <guilabel>ມຸມມອງ</"
"guilabel> ເພື່ອສະແດງສ່ວນຂອງແທັບ <guilabel>ມຸມມອງ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3352
msgid "<xref linkend=\"goscaja-TBL-30\"/> lists the views preferences that you can modify."
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"goscaja-TBL-30\"/> ສະແດງລາຍການການຕັ້ງຄ່າມຸມມອງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3371
msgid "<guilabel>View new folders using</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ເບິ່ງໂຟນເດີໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3376
msgid "Select the default view for folders. When you open a folder, the folder is displayed in the view that you select. This can be the icon view, the list view, or the compact view, which is a variant of the icon view that is organized in columns rather than rows."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກມຸມມອງມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບໂຟນເດີ. ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດໂຟນເດີ, ໂຟນເດີຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນມຸມມອງທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ສິ່ງ"
"ນີ້ສາມາດເປັນມຸມມອງໄອຄອນ, ມຸມມອງລາຍການ, ຫຼື ມຸມມອງແບບກະທັດຮັດ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຮູບແບບໜຶ່ງຂອງມຸມມອງໄອຄອ"
"ນທີ່ຖືກຈັດເປັນຄໍລຳແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນແຖວ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3382
msgid "<guilabel>Arrange items</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຈັດລຽງລາຍການ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3387
msgid "Select the characteristic by which you want to sort the items in folders that are displayed in this view."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໃນການຈັດລຽງລາຍການໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນມຸມມອງນີ້."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3393
msgid "<guilabel>Sort folders before files</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຈັດລຽງໂຟນເດີກ່ອນໄຟລ໌</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3398
msgid "Select this option to list folders before files when you sort a folder."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໂຟນເດີກ່ອນໄຟລ໌ເມື່ອທ່ານຈັດລຽງໂຟນເດີ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3404
msgid "<guilabel>Show hidden and backup files</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຊ່ອນຢູ່ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ສຳຮອງ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3409
msgid "Select this option to display files that are normally not shown in folders. For more on hidden files, see <xref linkend=\"caja-hidden-files\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຊ່"
"ອນຢູ່, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"caja-hidden-files\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3414
msgid "<guilabel>Default zoom level</guilabel> in the Icon View, Compact View, or List View sections"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>ລະດັບການຊູມມາດຕະຖານ</guilabel> ໃນສ່ວນ ມຸມມອງໄອຄອນ, ມຸມມອງແບບກະທັດຮັດ, ຫຼື ມຸມ"
"ມອງລາຍການ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3419
msgid "Select the default zoom level for folders that are displayed in this view. The zoom level specifies the size of items in a view."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກລະດັບການຊູມມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບໂຟນເດີທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນມຸມມອງນີ້. ລະດັບການຊູມຈະກຳນົດຂະໜາດຂອງລາຍການໃ"
"ນມຸມມອງ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3425
msgid "<guilabel>Use compact layout</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບແບບກະທັດຮັດ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3430
msgid "Select this option to arrange the items in icon view so that the items in the folder are closer to each other."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອຈັດລຽງລາຍການໃນມຸມມອງໄອຄອນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລາຍການໃນໂຟນເດີຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3437
msgid "<guilabel>Text beside icons</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂ້າງໄອຄອນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3442
msgid "Select this option to place the icon captions for items beside the icon rather than under the icon."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອວາງຄຳອະທິບາຍໄອຄອນສຳລັບລາຍການໄວ້ທາງຂ້າງໄອຄອນ ແທນທີ່ຈະຢູ່ໃຕ້ໄອຄອນ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3448
msgid "<guilabel>All columns have the same width</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ທຸກຄໍລຳມີຄວາມກວ້າງເທົ່າກັນ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3453
msgid "Select this option to make all columns in a compact view have the same width."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທຸກຄໍລຳໃນມຸມມອງແບບກະທັດຮັດມີຄວາມກວ້າງເທົ່າກັນ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3458
msgid "<guilabel>Show only folders</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ສະແດງສະເພາະໂຟນເດີ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3463
msgid "Select this option to display only folders in the <guilabel>Tree</guilabel> in the side pane."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງສະເພາະໂຟນເດີໃນ <guilabel>ແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້</guilabel> ໃນແຖບດ້ານຂ້າງ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3471
msgid "Behavior Preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຶດຕິກຳ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3472
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>preferences</secondary> <tertiary>behavior</tertiary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</secondary> <tertiary>ພຶດຕິກ"
"ຳ</tertiary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3477
msgid "To set your preferences for files and folders, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Preferences</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Click on the <guilabel>Behavior</guilabel> tab to display the <guilabel>Behavior</guilabel> tabbed section. You can set the following preferences:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມມັກຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ຄລິກໃສ່ແທັບ <guilabel>ພຶ"
"ດຕິກຳ</guilabel> ເພື່ອສະແດງສ່ວນຂອງແທັບ <guilabel>ພຶດຕິກຳ</guilabel>. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາ"
"ມມັກດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/goscaja.xml:3483
msgid "<guilabel>Single click to open items</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຄລິກບາດດຽວເພື່ອເປີດລາຍການ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3485
msgid "Select this option to perform the default action for an item when you click on the item. When this option is selected, and you point to an item, the title of the item is underlined."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດການມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກໃສ່ລາຍການນັ້ນ. ເມື່ອເລືອກຕົວເລືອ"
"ກນີ້, ແລະ ທ່ານຊີ້ໃສ່ລາຍການ, ຊື່ຂອງລາຍການຈະຖືກຂີດກ້ອງ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/goscaja.xml:3491
msgid "<guilabel>Double click to open items</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຄລິກສອງບາດເພື່ອເປີດລາຍການ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3493
msgid "Select this option to perform the default action for an item when you double-click on the item."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດການມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກສອງບາດໃສ່ລາຍການນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/goscaja.xml:3498
msgid "<guilabel>Always open in browser windows</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ເປີດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງບຣາວເຊີສະເໝີ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3500
msgid "Select this option to use <application>Caja</application> in browser mode rather than spatial mode. Selecting this lets you browse your files and folders in the same window, otherwise you will navigate your files and folders as objects."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ <application>Caja</application> ໃນໂໝດບຣາວເຊີແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນໂໝດຈັດການ"
"ແບບແຍກໜ້າຕ່າງ (spatial). ການເລືອກສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີຂອງທ່ານໃນໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວກັ"
"ນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ທ່ານຈະທ່ອງເບິ່ງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີຂອງທ່ານເປັນແບບວັດຖຸແຍກໜ້າຕ່າງ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/goscaja.xml:3505
msgid "<guilabel>Run executable text files when they are opened</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ສັ່ງລັນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສັ່ງການໄດ້ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກເປີດ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3507
msgid "Select this option to run an text executable file when you choose the file. An executable text file is a text file that can execute, that is, a shell script."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອລັນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສັ່ງການໄດ້ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ. ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສັ່ງການໄດ້ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່"
"ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນ: shell script."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/goscaja.xml:3513
msgid "<guilabel>View executable text files when they are opened</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>ເບິ່ງເນື້ອໃນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສັ່ງການໄດ້ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກເປີດ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3515
msgid "Select this option to display the contents of an executable text file when you choose the executable text file."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສັ່ງການໄດ້ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/goscaja.xml:3520
msgid "<guilabel>Ask each time</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຖາມທຸກຄັ້ງ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3522
msgid "Select this option to display a dialog when you choose an executable text file. The dialog asks whether you want to execute the file or display the file."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສັ່ງການໄດ້. ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖາມວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງກ"
"ານສັ່ງລັນໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ສະແດງເນື້ອໃນໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/goscaja.xml:3528
msgid "<guilabel>Ask before emptying the Trash or deleting files</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຖາມກ່ອນຖອກຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ ຫຼື ລຶບໄຟລ໌</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3530
msgid "Select this option to display a confirmation message before <guilabel>Trash</guilabel> is emptied, or files are deleted. Leave this selected unless you have good reason not to."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຢືນຢັນກ່ອນທີ່ <guilabel>ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel> ຈະຖືກຖອກ, ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ຖື"
"ກລຶບ. ຄວນເລືອກສິ່ງນີ້ໄວ້ ນອກຈາກວ່າທ່ານມີເຫດຜົນທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະບໍ່ເລືອກ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/goscaja.xml:3534
msgid "<guilabel>Include a Delete command that bypasses Trash</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ລວມຄຳສັ່ງ ລຶບ ທີ່ຂ້າມຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3536
msgid "Select this option to add a <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> menu item to the following menus:"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລາຍການເມນູ <guimenuitem>ລຶບ</guimenuitem> ເຂົ້າໃນເມນູດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3540
msgid "The <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu."
msgstr "ເມນູ <guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</guimenu>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3543
msgid "The popup menu that is displayed when you right-click on a file, folder, or desktop object."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູປ໊ອບອັບທີ່ສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄຟລ໌, ໂຟນເດີ, ຫຼື ວັດຖຸໃນເດັສທັອບ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3547
msgid "When you select an item then choose the <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> menu item, the item is deleted from your file system immediately. There is no way to recover a deleted file. Do not select this unless you have good reason to."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວເລືອກລາຍການເມນູ <guimenuitem>ລຶບ</guimenuitem>, ລາຍການນັ້ນຈ"
"ະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານທັນທີ. ບໍ່ມີວິທີທີ່ຈະກູ້ຄືນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກລຶບໄປແລ້ວ. ຢ່າເລືອກສິ່ງນີ້ ນອກຈາກວ່າທ່ານມີເ"
"ຫດຜົນທີ່ດີ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/goscaja.xml:3554
msgid "Display Preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3555
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>icons</secondary> <tertiary>caption preferences</tertiary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ໄອຄອນ</secondary> <tertiary>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄ"
"ຳອະທິບາຍ</tertiary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/goscaja.xml:3560
msgid "<primary>file manager</primary> <secondary>preferences</secondary> <tertiary>icon captions</tertiary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌</primary> <secondary>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</secondary> <tertiary>ຄຳອະທິບ"
"າຍໄອຄອນ</tertiary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3565
msgid "An icon caption displays the name of a file or folder in an icon view. The icon caption also includes three additional items of information on the file or folder. The additional information is displayed after the file name. Normally only one item of information is visible, but when you zoom in on an icon, more of the information is displayed. You can modify what additional information is displayed in icon captions."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍໄອຄອນຈະສະແດງຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີໃນມຸມມອງໄອຄອນ. ຄຳອະທິບາຍໄອຄອນຍັງລວມມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ"
"ສາມລາຍການກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະຖືກສະແດງຕໍ່ຈາກຊື່ໄຟລ໌. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ຂໍ້ມູນພຽງແຕ່"
"ລາຍການດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ, ແຕ່ເມື່ອທ່ານຊູມໄອຄອນໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ, ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກໍຈະສະແດງອອກມາຫຼາຍ"
"ຂຶ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ສະແດງໃນຄຳອະທິບາຍໄອຄອນໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3571
msgid "To set your preferences for icon captions, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Preferences</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Click on the <guilabel>Display</guilabel> tab to display the <guilabel>Display</guilabel> tabbed section."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມມັກຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍໄອຄອນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ແກ້ໄຂ</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. ຄລິກໃສ່ແທັບ <guilabel>ກ"
"ານສະແດງຜົນ</guilabel> ເພື່ອສະແດງສ່ວນຂອງແທັບ <guilabel>ການສະແດງຜົນ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3573
msgid "Select the items of information that you want to display in the icon caption from the three drop-down lists. Select the first item from the first drop-down list, select the second item from the second drop-down list, and so on. The following table describes the items of information that you can select:"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະແດງໃນຄຳອະທິບາຍໄອຄອນຈາກລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງທັງສາມ. ເລືອກລາຍກາ"
"ນທຳອິດຈາກລາຍການເລື່ອນລົງອັນທີໜຶ່ງ, ເລືອກລາຍການທີສອງຈາກລາຍການເລື່ອນລົງອັນທີສອງ, ແລະ ຕໍ່ໆໄປ. ຕາຕ"
"ະລາງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອະທິບາຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້:"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/goscaja.xml:3585
#: C/goscaja.xml:3725
msgid "Information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ"

