#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:352
msgid "Each workspace can have any number of applications open in it. The number of workspaces can be customized: see <xref linkend=\"workspace-add\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສາມາດມີແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເປີດຢູ່ຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດກໍໄດ້. ຈຳນວນພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້: ເບິ່"
"ງ <xref linkend=\"workspace-add\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:354
msgid "Workspaces enable you to organize the MATE Desktop when you run many applications at the same time. One way to use workspaces is to allocate a specific function to each workspace: one for email, one for web browsing, one for graphic design, etc. However, everyone has their own preference and you are in no way restricted to only using workspaces like this."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດລະບຽບເດັສທັອບ MATE ເມື່ອທ່ານລັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ. ວິທີໜຶ່ງໃ"
"ນການໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກແມ່ນການກຳນົດໜ້າທີ່ສະເພາະໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະພື້ນທີ່: ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບອີເມວ, ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບການທ່ອງເວັ"
"ບ, ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບການອອກແບບກຣາບຟິກ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທຸກຄົນລ້ວນແຕ່ມີຄວາມມັກສ່ວນຕົວ ແລະ ທ່"
"ານກໍບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນຮູບແບບນີ້ພຽງຢ່າງດຽວ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:357
msgid "Switching Between Workspaces"
msgstr "ການສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gosoverview.xml:358
msgid "<primary>workspaces</primary> <secondary>switching between</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ</primary> <secondary>ການສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:362
msgid "You can switch between workspaces in any of the following ways:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍວິທີໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:365
msgid "In the <application>Workspace Switcher</application> applet in the bottom panel, click on the workspace where you want to work."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແອັບເຈັດ <application>ຕົວສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ</application> ຢູ່ແຜງລຸ່ມ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທີ່"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:368
msgid "Move the mouse pointer over the <application>Workspace Switcher</application> applet in the bottom panel, and scroll the mouse wheel."
msgstr ""
"ວາງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງແອັບເຈັດ <application>ຕົວສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ</application> ຢູ່ແຜງລຸ່ມ, ແລ້ວເ"
"ລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:371
msgid "Press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>right arrow</keycap></keycombo> to switch to the workspace on the right of the current workspace."
msgstr ""
"ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>ລູກສອນຂວາ</"
"keycap></keycombo> ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບໄປຍັງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງພື້ນທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:375
msgid "Press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>left arrow</keycap></keycombo> to switch to the workspace on the left of the current workspace."
msgstr ""
"ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>ລູກສອນຊ້າຍ</"
"keycap></keycombo> ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບໄປຍັງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງພື້ນທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:379
msgid "The arrow shortcut keys work according to how your workspaces are set out in the <application>Workspace Switcher</application> applet. If you change your panel so workspaces are displayed vertically instead of horizontally, use <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>up arrow</keycap></keycombo> and <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>down arrow</keycap></keycombo> to switch workspaces."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມລັດລູກສອນຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມການຈັດວາງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານໃນແອັບເຈັດ <application>ຕົວສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດ"
"ວຽກ</application>. ຖ້າທ່ານປ່ຽນແຜງເພື່ອໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສະແດງໃນແນວຕັ້ງແທນແນວນອນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>ລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ</keycap></"
"keycombo> ແລະ <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>ລູກສອ"
"ນລົງ</keycap></keycombo> ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:381
msgid "Adding Workspaces"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gosoverview.xml:385
msgid "<primary>workspaces</primary> <secondary>specifying number of</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ</primary> <secondary>ການລະບຸຈຳນວນ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:389
msgid "To add workspaces to the MATE Desktop, right-click on the <application>Workspace Switcher</application> applet, then choose <guimenuitem>Preferences</guimenuitem>. The <guilabel>Workspace Switcher Preferences</guilabel> dialog is displayed. Use the <guilabel>Number of workspaces</guilabel> spin box to specify the number of workspaces that you require."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ກັບເດັສທັອບ MATE, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ແອັບເຈັດ <application>ຕົວສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽ"
"ກ</application>, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</guimenuitem>. ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ "
"<guilabel>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ</guilabel> ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ. ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງປັບຕົວເລກ "
"<guilabel>ຈຳນວນພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ</guilabel> ເພື່ອລະບຸຈຳນວນພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:395
msgid "Applications"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gosoverview.xml:399
msgid "<primary>applications</primary> <secondary>overview</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</primary> <secondary>ພາບລວມ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:404
msgid "An <firstterm>application</firstterm> is a type of computer program that allows you to perform a particular task. You might use applications to create text documents such as letters or reports; to work with spreadsheets; to listen to your favorite music; to navigate the Internet; or to create, edit, or view images and videos. For each of these tasks, you would use a different application."
msgstr ""
"<firstterm>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</firstterm> ແມ່ນປະເພດຂອງໂປຣແກຣມຄອມພິວເຕີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດວຽ"
"ກໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ. ທ່ານອາດຈະໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເພື່ອສ້າງເອກະສານຂໍ້ຄວາມ ເຊັ່ນ: ຈົດໝາຍ ຫຼື ລາຍງານ; ເຮັ"
"ດວຽກກັບສະເປຣດຊີດ; ຟັງເພງທີ່ທ່ານມັກ; ທ່ອງອິນເຕີເນັດ; ຫຼື ສ້າງ, ແກ້ໄຂ, ຫຼື ເບິ່ງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ວິດີໂອ. ສຳ"
"ລັບແຕ່ລະວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:406
msgid "To launch an application, open the <guimenu>Applications</guimenu> menu and choose the application you want from the submenus. For more on this, see <xref linkend=\"applications-menu\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດເມນູ <guimenu>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guimenu> ແລ້ວເລືອກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈາກເມນູຍ່ອຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"applications-menu\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:408
msgid "The applications that are part of MATE include the following:"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ MATE ລວມມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:411
msgid "<link xlink:href=\"help:pluma\"><application>Pluma Text Editor</application></link> can read, create, or modify any kind of simple text without any formatting."
msgstr ""
"<link xlink:href=\"help:pluma\"><application>Pluma Text Editor</application>"
"</link> ສາມາດອ່ານ, ສ້າງ, ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາທຸກປະເພດໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຈັດຮູບແບບ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:412
msgid "<link xlink:href=\"help:mate-dictionary\"><application>Dictionary</application></link> allows you to look up definitions of a word."
msgstr ""
"<link xlink:href=\"help:mate-dictionary\"><application>Dictionary</"
"application></link> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຄຳນິຍາມຂອງຄຳສັບໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:413
msgid "<link xlink:href=\"help:eom\"><application>Image Viewer</application></link> can display single image files, as well as large image collections."
msgstr ""
"<link xlink:href=\"help:eom\"><application>Image Viewer</application></link> "
"ສາມາດສະແດງໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບດ່ຽວໆ, ລວມທັງຄໍເລັກຊັນຮູບພາບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:414
msgid "<link xlink:href=\"help:gucharmap\"><application>Character Map</application></link> lets you choose letters and symbols from the <firstterm>Unicode</firstterm> character set and paste them into any application. If you are writing in several languages, not all the characters you need will be on your keyboard."
msgstr ""
"<link xlink:href=\"help:gucharmap\"><application>Character Map</application>"
"</link> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ສັນຍະລັກຈາກຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນ <firstterm>ຢູນິໂຄດ (Unicode)"
"</firstterm> ແລະ ວາງພວກມັນລົງໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃດກໍໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຂຽນຫຼາຍພາສາ, ຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດ"
"ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຄີບອດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:415
msgid "<application>Caja File Manager</application> (see <xref linkend=\"caja\"/>) displays your folders and their contents. Use this to copy, move and classify your files, and to access CDs, USB flash drives, and any other removable media. When you choose an item from the <xref linkend=\"places-menu\"/>, a <application>Caja File Manager</application> window opens showing that location."
msgstr ""
"<application>Caja File Manager</application> (ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"caja\"/>) ສ"
"ະແດງໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ເນື້ອໃນຂອງພວກມັນ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອສຳເນົາ, ຍ້າຍ ແລະ ຈັດໝວດໝູ່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ເພື່ອເ"
"ຂົ້າເຖິງ CD, USB flash drive, ແລະ ສື່ທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້ອື່ນໆ. ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກລາຍການຈາກ <xref "
"linkend=\"places-menu\"/>, ໜ້າຕ່າງ <application>Caja File Manager</"
"application> ຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນເພື່ອສະແດງສະຖານທີ່ນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:416
msgid "<link xlink:href=\"help:mate-terminal\"><application>Terminal</application></link> gives you access to the system command line."
msgstr ""
"<link xlink:href=\"help:mate-terminal\"><application>Terminal</application></"
"link> ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) ຂອງລະບົບ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:419
msgid "Further standard MATE applications include games, music and video players, a web browser, software accessibility tools, and utilities to manage your system. Your distributor or vendor may have added other applications, such as a word processor and a graphics editor. They may also provide you with a way to install further applications."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນມາດຕະຖານອື່ນໆຂອງ MATE ລວມມີເກມ, ເຄື່ອງຫຼິ້ນເພງ ແລະ ວິດີໂອ, ເວັບບຣາວເຊີ, ເຄື່ອງມືຊ່ວຍ"
"ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຊອບແວ, ແລະ ໂປຣແກຣມອັດປະໂຫຍດເພື່ອຈັດການລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ. ຜູ້ຈຳໜ່າຍ ຫຼື ຜູ້ຜະລິດຂອງທ່ານອາ"
"ດຈະເພີ່ມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ໂປຣແກຣມພິມເອກະສານ ແລະ ໂປຣແກຣມແກ້ໄຂກຣາບຟິກ. ພວກເຂົາອາດຈະມີວິ"
"ທີການຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃຫ້ທ່ານນຳ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:421
msgid "All MATE applications have many features in common, which makes it easier to learn how to work with a new MATE application. The rest of this section describes some of these features."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ MATE ທັງໝົດມີຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ຄືກັນ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນໃນການຮຽນຮູ້ວິທີເຮັດວຽກກັບແອັບພລິເຄ"
"ຊັນ MATE ໃໝ່. ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍເຖິງຄຸນສົມບັດບາງຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:423
msgid "Common Features"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດທົ່ວໄປ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:424
msgid "The applications that are provided with the MATE Desktop share many common features, such as similar open and save dialogs and similar-looking icons. This is because they have all been developed using the MATE development platform. An application developed using this platform is called a <firstterm>MATE-compliant application</firstterm>. For example, <application>Caja</application> and the <application>pluma</application> text editor are MATE-compliant applications."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ມາກັບເດັສທັອບ MATE ມີຄຸນສົມບັດທົ່ວໄປຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ຮ່ວມກັນ, ເຊັ່ນ: ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປີດ ແລະ ບັນທຶກທີ່"
"ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ ແລະ ໄອຄອນທີ່ມີຮູບລັກສະນະຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າພວກມັນທັງໝົດຖືກພັດທະນາໂດຍໃຊ້ແພລັດຟອມການພັດ"
"ທະນາຂອງ MATE. ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ພັດທະນາໂດຍໃຊ້ແພລັດຟອມນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ <firstterm>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"MATE (MATE-compliant application)</firstterm>. ຕົວຢ່າງ, <application>Caja</"
"application> ແລະ ໂປຣແກຣມແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ <application>pluma</application> ແມ່ນແອັບພລິເຄ"
"ຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MATE."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:426
msgid "Some features of MATE-compliant applications are as follows:"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດບາງຢ່າງຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MATE ມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:429
msgid "Consistent look-and-feel"
msgstr "ຮູບລັກສະນະ ແລະ ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:430
msgid "MATE-compliant applications have a consistent look-and-feel. You can use the <xref linkend=\"prefs-theme\"/> tool to change the look-and-feel of your MATE-compliant applications."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MATE ມີຮູບລັກສະນະ ແລະ ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື <xref "
"linkend=\"prefs-theme\"/> ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຮູບລັກສະນະ ແລະ ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MATE ຂ"
"ອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:433
msgid "Menubars, toolbars, and statusbars"
msgstr "ແຖບເມນູ, ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື, ແລະ ແຖບສະຖານະ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:434
msgid "Most MATE-compliant applications have a menubar, a toolbar, and a statusbar. The menubars usually have a similar structure; for example, the <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu always contains an <guimenuitem>About</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MATE ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີແຖບເມນູ, ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື, ແລະ ແຖບສະຖານະ. ແຖບເມນູມັກຈະມີໂຄງສ້າ"
"ງທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ; ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເມນູ <guimenu>ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ</guimenu> ຈະປະກອບມີລາຍການເມນູ "
"<guimenuitem>ກ່ຽວກັບ</guimenuitem> ສະເໝີ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:437
msgid "A <firstterm>toolbar</firstterm> is a bar that appears under the menubar. A toolbar contains buttons for the most commonly-used commands. A <firstterm>statusbar</firstterm> is a bar at the bottom of a window that provides information about the current state of what you are viewing in the window. Applications might also contains other bars. For example, <application>Caja</application> contains a location bar."
msgstr ""
"<firstterm>ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື (toolbar)</firstterm> ແມ່ນແຖບທີ່ປາກົດຢູ່ໃຕ້ແຖບເມນູ. ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືປະກອບ"
"ມີປຸ່ມສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆທີ່ສຸດ. <firstterm>ແຖບສະຖານະ (statusbar)</firstterm> ແມ່ນແຖບທີ່ຢູ່"
"ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເບິ່ງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ. ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອາດຈະປະ"
"ກອບມີແຖບອື່ນໆນຳ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, <application>Caja</application> ປະກອບມີແຖບສະຖານທີ່."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:441
msgid "Default shortcut keys"
msgstr "ຄີບອດລັດມາດຕະຖານ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:442
msgid "MATE-compliant applications use the same shortcut keys to perform the same actions. See <xref linkend=\"keyboard-skills\"/> for a list of common shortcut keys."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MATE ໃຊ້ຄີບອດລັດດຽວກັນເພື່ອປະຕິບັດການດຽວກັນ. ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"keyboard-skills\"/> ສຳລັບລາຍການຄີບອດລັດທົ່ວໄປ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:446
msgid "Drag-and-drop"
msgstr "ການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ (Drag-and-drop)"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:447
msgid "When you drag-and-drop something into a MATE-compliant application, it will recognize the format of the items that you dragged and will handle them in an appropriate manner. For example, when you drag an HTML file from a <application>Caja</application> window to a web browser, the file is displayed in HTML format in the browser. However, when you drag the HTML file to a text editor, the file is displayed in plain text format in the text editor."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານລາກ ແລະ ວາງບາງຢ່າງລົງໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MATE, ມັນຈະຈົດຈຳຮູບແບບຂອງລາຍການທີ່ທ່ານລາ"
"ກມາ ແລະ ຈະຈັດການກັບພວກມັນໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເມື່ອທ່ານລາກໄຟລ໌ HTML ຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"<application>Caja</application> ໄປຫາເວັບບຣາວເຊີ, ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບ HTML ໃນບຣາ"
"ວເຊີ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເມື່ອທ່ານລາກໄຟລ໌ HTML ໄປຫາໂປຣແກຣມແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນຮູບແບ"
"ບຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາໃນໂປຣແກຣມນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:458
msgid "Working With Files"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກກັບໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:459
msgid "The work you do with an application is stored in <firstterm>files</firstterm>. These may be on your computer's hard drive, or on a removable device such as a USB flash drive. You <firstterm>open</firstterm> a file to examine it or work on it, and you <firstterm>save</firstterm> a file to store your work. When you are done working with a file, you <firstterm>close</firstterm> it."
msgstr ""
"ວຽກທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດດ້ວຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ <firstterm>ໄຟລ໌ (files)</firstterm>. ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້"
"ອາດຈະຢູ່ໃນຮາດໄດຣຟ໌ຂອງຄອມພິວເຕີ, ຫຼື ໃນອຸປະກອນທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ: USB flash drive. ທ່ານ "
"<firstterm>ເປີດ (open)</firstterm> ໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອຂຶ້ນມາກວດສອບ ຫຼື ເຮັດວຽກ, ແລະ ທ່ານ "
"<firstterm>ບັນທຶກ (save)</firstterm> ໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເກັບຮັກສາວຽກຂອງທ່ານ. ເມື່ອທ່ານເຮັດວຽກກັບໄຟລ໌ສ"
"ຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານກໍ <firstterm>ປິດ (close)</firstterm> ມັນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:460
msgid "All MATE applications use the same dialogs for opening and saving files, presenting you with a consistent interface. The following sections cover the open and the save dialog in detail."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ MATE ທັງໝົດໃຊ້ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມດຽວກັນໃນການເປີດ ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌, ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງ"
"ກັນ. ຫົວຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະລົງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປີດ ແລະ ບັນທຶກ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:463
msgid "Choosing a File to Open"
msgstr "ການເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະເປີດ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:464
msgid "The <guilabel>Open File</guilabel> dialog allows you to choose a file to open in an application."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ເປີດໄຟລ໌</guilabel> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະເປີດໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:465
msgid "The right-hand pane of the dialog lists files and folders in the current location. You can use the mouse or the arrow keys on your keyboard to select a file."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບດ້ານຂວາຂອງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີໃນສະຖານທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ປຸ່"
"ມລູກສອນເທິງຄີບອດເພື່ອເລືອກໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:466
msgid "Once a file is selected in the list, perform one of the following actions to open it:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເລືອກໄຟລ໌ໃນລາຍການແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດສິ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດມັນ:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:468
msgid "Click <guibutton>Open</guibutton>."
msgstr "ຄລິກ <guibutton>ເປີດ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:469
msgid "Press <keycap>Return</keycap>."
msgstr "ກົດ <keycap>Enter</keycap>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:470
msgid "Press <keycap>Spacebar</keycap>."
msgstr "ກົດ <keycap>ປຸ່ມຍະວ່າງ (Spacebar)</keycap>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:471
msgid "Double-click the file."
msgstr "ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:473
msgid "If you open a folder or a location instead of a file, the <guilabel>Open File</guilabel> dialog updates to show the contents of that folder or location."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າເປີດໂຟນເດີ ຫຼື ສະຖານທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນໄຟລ໌, ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເປີດໄຟລ໌</"
"guilabel> ຈະອັບເດດເພື່ອສະແດງເນື້ອຫາຂອງໂຟນເດີ ຫຼື ສະຖານທີ່ນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:475
msgid "To change the location shown in the right-hand pane, do one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນສະຖານທີ່ທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຂວາ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:477
msgid "Open a folder that is listed in the current location."
msgstr "ເປີດໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີລາຍຊື່ອຍູ່ໃນສະຖານທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:478
msgid "Open an item in the left-hand pane. This pane lists places such as your Documents folder, your Home Folder, media such as CDs and flash drives, places on your network, and your bookmarks (see <xref linkend=\"caja-bookmarks\"/> for more on bookmarks)."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດລາຍການໃນຊ່ອງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ. ຊ່ອງນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ສະຖານທີ່ຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ໂຟນເດີເອກະສານ, ໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ "
"(Home), ສື່ຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ຊີດີ ແລະ ແຟລັດໄດຣຟ໌, ສະຖານທີ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ບຸກມາກ (ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"caja-bookmarks\"/> ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບຸກມາກ)."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:479
msgid "Click one of the buttons in the path bar above the file listing pane. This shows the hierarchy of folders that contain your current location. Use the arrow buttons to either side of the button bar if the list of folders is too long to fit."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງໃນແຖບເສັ້ນທາງ (path bar) ທີ່ຢູ່ເິງຊ່ອງລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌. ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະສະແດງລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງໂຟນເດີທີ່ບັນຈຸ"
"ສະຖານທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ. ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລູກສອນຢູ່ແຕ່ລະດ້ານຂອງແຖບປຸ່ມ ຫາກລາຍຊື່ໂຟນເດີຍາວເກີນໄປ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:482
msgid "The lower part of the <guilabel>Open File</guilabel> dialog may contain further options specific to the current application."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເປີດໄຟລ໌</guilabel> ອາດຈະມີຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມສະເພາະສຳລັບແອັບພ"
"ລິເຄຊັນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:484
msgid "Filtering the File List"
msgstr "ການກັ່ນຕອງລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:485
msgid "You can restrict the file list to show only files of certain types. To do this, choose a file type from the drop-down list beneath the file list pane. The list of file types depends on the application you are currently using. For example, a graphics application will list different image file formats, and a text editor will list different types of text file."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ສະແດງສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ບາງປະເພດໄດ້. ໂດຍການເລືອກປະເພດໄຟລ໌ຈາກລາຍການແບບ"
"ເລື່ອນລົງ ທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງຊ່ອງລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌. ລາຍຊື່ປະເພດໄຟລ໌ຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແອັບ"
"ພລິເຄຊັນດ້ານກຣາຟິກ ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບຕ່າງໆ, ແລະ ໂປຣແກຣມແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໄ"
"ຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມປະເພດຕ່າງໆ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:488
msgid "Find-as-you-type"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຂະນະທີ່ພິມ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:489
msgid "If you know the name of the file you want to open, begin typing it: the file list will jump to show you files whose names begin with the characters you type. Arrow keys will now select from only these files. The characters you have typed appear in a pop-up window at the base of the file list."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຮູ້ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເປີດ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມຊື່ໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ: ລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຈະໂດດໄປສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ເ"
"ຈົ້າພິມ. ປຸ່ມລູກສອນຈະເລືອກໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນບັນດາໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ເຈົ້າພິມຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມປ໊ອບອັບຢູ່"
"ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:490
msgid "To cancel find-as-you-type, press <keycap>Esc</keycap>."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການຄົ້ນຫາຂະນະທີ່ພິມ, ໃຫ້ກົດ <keycap>Esc</keycap>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:493
msgid "Choosing a folder"
msgstr "ການເລືອກໂຟນເດີ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:494
msgid "You might sometimes need to choose a folder to work with rather than open a file. For example, if you use <link xlink:href=\"help:engrampa\"><application>Archive Manager</application></link> to extract files from an archive, you need to choose a folder to place the files into. In this case, the files in the current location are greyed out, and pressing <guibutton>Open</guibutton> when a folder is selected will choose that folder."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄັ້ງເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງເລືອກໂຟນເດີເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການເປີດໄຟລ໌. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກເຈົ້າໃຊ້ <link "
"xlink:href=\"help:engrampa\"><application>ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ (Archive Manager)</"
"application></link> ເພື່ອແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ເກັບມ້ຽນ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງເລືອກໂຟນເດີເພື່ອວາງໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້"
"ນ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆໃນສະຖານທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນຈະເປັນສີເທົາ, ແລະ ການກົດ <guibutton>ເປີດ</"
"guibutton> ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລືອກໂຟນເດີຈະເປັນການເລືອກໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:497
msgid "Open Location"
msgstr "ເປີດທີ່ຢູ່"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:498
msgid "You can type a full or relative path to the file you want to open. Press <keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>L</keycap></keycombo> or click the button at the top left of the window to show (or hide) the <guilabel>Location</guilabel> field. Alternatively, begin typing a full path starting with <filename>/</filename> to show the <guilabel>Location</guilabel> field."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດພິມເສັ້ນທາງແບບເຕັມ ຫຼື ແບບທຽບຖານໄປຍັງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເປີດໄດ້. ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>"
"Ctrl</keycap><keycap>L</keycap></keycombo> ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ ເພື່ອສະແ"
"ດງ (ຫຼື ເຊື່ອງ) ຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ສະຖານທີ່</guilabel>. ຫຼືອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມພິມເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວ"
"ຍ <filename>/</filename> ເພື່ອສະແດງຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ສະຖານທີ່</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:499
msgid "Type a path from the current location, or an absolute path beginning with <filename>/</filename> or <filename>~/</filename>. The <guilabel>Location</guilabel> field has the following features to simplify the typing of a full filename:"
msgstr ""
"ພິມເສັ້ນທາງຈາກສະຖານທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນ, ຫຼື ເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ <filename>/</filename> ຫຼື "
"<filename>~/</filename>. ຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ສະຖານທີ່</guilabel> ມີຄຸນສົມບັດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃ"
"ຫ້ການພິມຊື່ໄຟລ໌ເຕັມງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:501
msgid "A drop-down of possible file and folder names is displayed once you begin typing. Use <keycap>down arrow</keycap> and <keycap>up arrow</keycap> and <keycap>Return</keycap> to choose from the list."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງຂອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລີ່ມພິມ. ໃຊ້ <keycap>ລູກສອ"
"ນລົງ</keycap>, <keycap>ລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ</keycap> ແລະ <keycap>Enter (Return)</keycap> ເພື່"
"ອເລືອກຈາກລາຍການ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:502
msgid "If the part of the name typed uniquely identifies a file or folder, the name is auto-completed. Press <keycap>Tab</keycap> to accept the suggested text. For example, if you type \"Do\", and the only object in the folder beginning with \"Do\" is <filename>Documents</filename>, then the entire name appears in the field."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກສ່ວນຂອງຊື່ທີ່ພິມໄປນັ້ນກົງກັບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີພຽງອັນດຽວ, ຊື່ນັ້ນຈະຖືກເຕີມໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ກົດ "
"<keycap>Tab</keycap> ເພື່ອຍອມຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແນະນຳ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກເຈົ້າພິມ \"Do\", ແລະ ສິ່ງດຽວໃນ"
"ໂຟນເດີທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ \"Do\" ແມ່ນ <filename>Documents</filename>, ຊື່ທັງໝົດຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນໃນຊ່ອງນັ້"
"ນ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:506
msgid "Opening Remote Locations"
msgstr "ການເປີດສະຖານທີ່ທາງໄກ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:507
msgid "You can open files in remote locations by choosing the location from the left panel, or by typing a path to a remote location into the <guilabel>Location</guilabel> field."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໄຟລ໌ໃນສະຖານທີ່ທາງໄກໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກສະຖານທີ່ຈາກແຜງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ຫຼື ໂດຍການພິມເສັ້ນທາງ "
"ໄປຍັງສະຖານທີ່ທາງໄກລົງໃນຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ສະຖານທີ່</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:508
msgid "If you require a password to access the remote location, you will be asked for it when you open it."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງສະຖານທີ່ທາງໄກ, ເຈົ້າຈະຖືກຖາມຫາລະຫັດຜ່ານເມື່ອເປີດມັນ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:511
msgid "Adding and Removing Bookmarks"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມ ແລະ ລຶບບຸກມາກ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:512
msgid "To add the current location to the bookmarks list, press <guibutton>Add</guibutton>, or right-click a folder in the file list and choose <guimenuitem>Add to Bookmarks</guimenuitem>. You can add any folder that is listed in the current location by dragging it to the bookmarks list."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມສະຖານທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນເຂົ້າໃນລາຍຊື່ບຸກມາກ, ໃຫ້ກົດ <guibutton>ເພີ່ມ (Add)</guibutton>, ຫຼື ຄລິກ"
"ຂວາໃສ່ໂຟນເດີ ໃນລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນບຸກມາກ</guimenuitem>. ເຈົ້າສາມາ"
"ດເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີໃດກໍໄດ້ ທີ່ມີລາຍຊື່ອຍູ່ໃນສະຖານທີ່ປັດຈຸບັນ ໂດຍການລາກມັນໄປໃສ່ລາຍຊື່ບຸກມາກ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:513
msgid "To remove a bookmark from the list, select it and press <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລຶບບຸກມາກອອກຈາກລາຍການ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກມັນແລ້ວກົດ <guibutton>ລຶບອອກ (Remove)</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:514
msgid "Changes you make to the bookmarks list also affect the <guimenu>Places</guimenu> menu. For more on bookmarks, see <xref linkend=\"caja-bookmarks\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເຈົ້າເຮັດກັບລາຍຊື່ບຸກມາກຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ເມນູ <guimenu>ສະຖານທີ່ (Places)</guimenu> ນຳ. "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບບຸກມາກ, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"caja-bookmarks\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:517
msgid "Showing hidden files"
msgstr "ການສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:518
msgid "To show hidden files in the file list, right-click in the file list and choose <guimenuitem>Show Hidden Files</guimenuitem>. For more on hidden files, see <xref linkend=\"caja-managing-hidden-files\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໃນລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃນລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ສະແດງໄຟລ໌"
"ທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້</guimenuitem>. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້, ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"caja-managing-hidden-files\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:522
msgid "Saving a File"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:523
msgid "The first time you save your work in an application, the <guilabel>Save As</guilabel> dialog will ask you for a location and name for the new file. When you save the file on subsequent occasions it will be updated immediately and you will not be asked to re-enter a location or name for the file. To save to a new file, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Save As</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ເຈົ້າບັນທຶກວຽກໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ບັນທຶກເປັນ (Save As)</"
"guilabel> ຈະຖາມຫາສະຖານທີ່ ແລະ ຊື່ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆໄປ ມັນຈະຖືກອັບເດດທັນທີ "
"ແລະ ເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ປ້ອນສະຖານທີ່ ຫຼື ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຄືນໃໝ່. ເພື່ອບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ໄຟລ໌ (File)</guimenu><guimenuitem>ບັນທຶກເປັນ (Save As)</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:524
msgid "You can enter a filename and choose a location to save in from the drop-down list of bookmarks and commonly-used locations."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ້ອນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ເລືອກສະຖານທີ່ທີ່ຈະບັນທຶກໄດ້ຈາກລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງຂອງບຸກມາກ ແລະ ສະຖານທີ່ທີ່"
"ໃຊ້ເປັນປະຈຳ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:526
msgid "Saving in another location"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກໃນສະຖານທີ່ອື່ນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:527
msgid "To save the file in a location not listed in the drop-down list, click the <guilabel>Browse for other folders</guilabel> expansion label. This shows a file browser similar to the one in the <guilabel>Open File</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ໃນສະຖານທີ່ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປ້າຍຂະຫຍາຍ <guilabel>ຊອກຫາໂຟນເດີ"
"ອື່ນໆ</guilabel>. ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະສະແດງຕົວທ່ອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບອັນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເປີດໄຟລ໌</"
"guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:528
msgid "The expanded <guilabel>Save File</guilabel> dialog has the same features as the <guilabel>Open File</guilabel> dialog (see <xref linkend=\"filechooser-open\"/>), such as filtering, find-as-you-type, and adding and removing bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌</guilabel> ທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍອອກມາ ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຄືກັນກັບກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ "
"<guilabel>ເປີດໄຟລ໌</guilabel> (ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"filechooser-open\"/>), ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການກັ່ນຕອງ, ການຄົ້ນຫາຂະນະທີ່ພິມ, ແລະ ການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບບຸກມາກ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:531
msgid "Replacing an existing file"
msgstr "ການຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:532
msgid "If you type in the name of an existing file, you will be asked whether you wish to replace the existing file with your current work. You can also do this by choosing the file you want to overwrite in the browser."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າພິມຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈະຖືກຖາມວ່າຕ້ອງການແທນທີ່ໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນດ້ວຍວຽກປັດຈຸບັນຂອງເຈົ້າຫຼືບໍ່. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເ"
"ຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຂຽນທັບໃນຕົວທ່ອງໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:535
msgid "Typing a Path"
msgstr "ການພິມເສັ້ນທາງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:536
msgid "To specify a path to save a file, type it into the <guilabel>Name</guilabel> field. A drop-down of possible file and folder names is displayed once you begin typing. Use <keycap>down arrow</keycap> and <keycap>up arrow</keycap> and <keycap>Return</keycap> to choose from the list. If only one file or folder matches the partial name you have typed, press <keycap>Tab</keycap> to complete the name."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໃນການບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌, ໃຫ້ພິມມັນລົງໃນຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ຊື່ (Name)</guilabel>. ລາຍການ"
"ແບບເລື່ອນລົງຂອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລີ່ມພິມ. ໃຊ້ <keycap>ລູກສອນລົງ</"
"keycap>, <keycap>ລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ</keycap> ແລະ <keycap>Enter (Return)</keycap> ເພື່ອເລືອກ"
"ຈາກລາຍການ. ຫາກມີພຽງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີດຽວທີ່ກົງກັບຊື່ບາງສ່ວນທີ່ເຈົ້າພິມ, ໃຫ້ກົດ <keycap>Tab</"
"keycap> ເພື່ອເຕີມຊື່ໃຫ້ເຕັມ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosoverview.xml:539
msgid "Creating a New Folder"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໂຟນເດີໃໝ່"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosoverview.xml:540
msgid "If you would like to create a new folder to save your file in, press the <guibutton>Create Folder</guibutton> button. Type a name for the new folder and press <keycap>Return</keycap>. You can then choose to save your file in the new folder, as you would with any other folder."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງໂຟນເດີໃໝ່ເພື່ອບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ສ້າງໂຟນເດີ</guibutton>. ພິມຊື່"
"ສຳລັບໂຟນເດີໃໝ່ແລ້ວກົດ <keycap>Enter (Return)</keycap>. ຈາກນັ້ນເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ ໃນ"
"ໂຟນເດີໃໝ່ນັ້ນໄດ້ ຄືກັນກັບໂຟນເດີອື່ນໆ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:7
msgid "Using the Panels"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານແຜງ (Panels)"

#. (itstool) path: highlights/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:16
msgid "This chapter describes how to use the panels at the top and bottom of the MATE Desktop, how to customize the objects that appear on them, and how to add new panels to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"ບົດນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການໃຊ້ງານແຜງຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງເດັສທັອບ MATE, ວິທີປັບແຕ່ງວັດ"
"ຖຸທີ່ປາກົດຢູ່ເທິງແຜງ, ແລະ ວິທີເພີ່ມແຜງໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນເດັສທັອບ."

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:24
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>introduction</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ບົດນຳ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:29
msgid "A panel is an area in the MATE Desktop where you have access to certain actions and information, no matter what the state of your application windows. For example, in the default MATE panels, you can launch applications, see the date and time, control the system sound volume, and more."
msgstr ""
"ແຜງ (Panel) ແມ່ນພື້ນທີ່ໃນເດັສທັອບ MATE ທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງການເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນບາງຢ່າງໄດ້, ບໍ່ວ່າ"
"ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງເຈົ້າຈະຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະໃດກໍຕາມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນແຜງມາດຕະຖານຂອງ MATE, ເຈົ້າສາມາ"
"ດ ເປີດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ເບິ່ງວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາ, ຄວບຄຸມລະດັບສຽງຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:30
msgid "You can customize panels to your liking. You can change their behavior and appearance, and you can add or remove objects from your panels. You can create multiple panels, and choose different properties, objects, and backgrounds for each panel. You can also hide panels."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງແຜງໄດ້ຕາມໃຈມັກ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳ ແລະ ຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງມັນ, ແລະ ສາມາດເພີ່ມ "
"ຫຼື ລຶບວັດຖຸອອກຈາກແຜງໄດ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງແຜງໄດ້ຫຼາຍອັນ, ແລະ ເລືອກຄຸນສົມບັດ, ວັດຖຸ, ແລະ ພື້ນຫຼັງ ທີ່ແຕກ"
"ຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແຜງ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ເຈົ້າກໍຍັງສາມາດເຊື່ອງແຜງໄດ້ນຳ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:31
msgid "By default, the MATE Desktop contains a panel at the top edge of the screen, and a panel at the bottom edge of the screen. The following sections describe these panels."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວ, ເດັສທັອບ MATE ຈະມີແຜງຢູ່ຂອບເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ແຜງຢູ່ຂອບລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆ "
"ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບແຜງເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:35
msgid "Top Edge Panel"
msgstr "ແຜງຂອບເທິງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:38
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>top edge panel</secondary> <see>top edge panel</see>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ແຜງຂອບເທິງ</secondary> <see>ແຜງຂອບເທິງ</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:43
msgid "<primary>top edge panel</primary> <secondary>introduction</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງຂອບເທິງ</primary> <secondary>ບົດນຳ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:47
msgid "By default, the top edge panel contains the following objects:"
msgstr "ຕາມມາດຕະຖານ, ແຜງຂອບເທິງຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍວັດຖຸດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:48
#: C/gospanel.xml:104
msgid "Your distribution of MATE may have altered this default setup."
msgstr "ລຸ້ນຂອງ MATE ທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຢູ່ອາດຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າມາດຕະຖານນີ້."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:52
msgid "<application>Classic Menu</application> applet"
msgstr "ແອັບເພັດ <application>ເມນູແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (Classic Menu)</application>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:53
msgid "The Classic Menu contains the <guimenu>Applications</guimenu>, <guimenu>Places</guimenu>, and <guimenu>System</guimenu> menus. For more on the classic menu, see <xref linkend=\"menubar\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູແບບດັ້ງເດີມປະກອບດ້ວຍເມນູ <guimenu>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guimenu>, <guimenu>ສະຖານທີ່</"
"guimenu>, ແລະ <guimenu>ລະບົບ</guimenu>. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເມນູແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ເບິ່ງ "
"<xref linkend=\"menubar\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:56
msgid "A set of application launcher icons"
msgstr "ຊຸດໄອຄອນຕົວເປີດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:57
msgid "The exact number of icons depends on your MATE distribution, but in general you will find at least a launcher for the <application>Web Browser</application>, an <application>Email client</application> and the <application>Help Browser</application>. Click on any launcher icon to open the corresponding application."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນໄອຄອນທີ່ແນ່ນອນຈະຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບລຸ້ນ MATE ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແຕ່ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ເຈົ້າຈະພົບເຫັນຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ ສ"
"ຳລັບ <application>ເວັບບຣາວເຊີ</application>, <application>ໂປຣແກຣມຮັບສົ່ງອີເມລ</"
"application> ແລະ <application>ຕົວທ່ອງວິທີໃຊ້</application>. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່"
"ອເປີດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:60
msgid "<application>Notification Area</application> applet"
msgstr "ແອັບເພັດ <application>ເຂດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (Notification Area)</application>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:61
msgid "Displays icons from other applications that may require your attention, or that you may want to access without switching from your current application window. For more on this, see <xref linkend=\"panels-notification-area\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງໄອຄອນຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໆ ທີ່ອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສົນໃຈ, ຫຼື ທີ່ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ໂດຍບໍ່"
"ຕ້ອງສະຫຼັບອອກຈາກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນປັດຈຸບັນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"panels-"
"notification-area\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:62
msgid "Until an application adds an icon to the notification area, only a narrow bar is visible."
msgstr ""
"ຈົນກວ່າຈະມີແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃດໜຶ່ງເພີ່ມໄອຄອນເຂົ້າໃນເຂດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນພຽງແຕ່ແຖບແຄບໆ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:68
msgid "<application>Clock</application> applet"
msgstr "ແອັບເພັດ <application>ໂມງ</application>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:69
msgid "The <application>Clock</application> shows the current time. Click on the time to open a small calendar. You can also view a world map by clicking the <guilabel>Locations</guilabel> expansion label. For more on this, see the <link xlink:href=\"help:mate-clock\">Clock Applet Manual</link>."
msgstr ""
"<application>ໂມງ</application> ຈະສະແດງເວລາປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄລິກທີ່ເວລາເພື່ອເປີດປະຕິທິນຂະໜາດນ້ອ"
"ຍ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເບິ່ງແຜນທີ່ໂລກໄດ້ໂດຍຄລິກທີ່ປ້າຍຂະຫຍາຍ <guilabel>ສະຖານທີ່</guilabel>. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູ"
"ນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ <link xlink:href=\"help:mate-clock\">ຄູ່ມືແອັບເພັດໂມງ</link>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:73
msgid "<application>Volume Control</application> applet"
msgstr "ແອັບເພັດ <application>ຄວບຄຸມລະດັບສຽງ</application>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:75
msgid "The <application>Volume Control</application> enables you to control the volume of the speakers on your system. For more on this, see the Volume Control Manual."
msgstr ""
"<application>ຄວບຄຸມລະດັບສຽງ</application> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມລະດັບສຽງຂອງລຳໂພງໃນລະ"
"ບົບໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ ຄູ່ມືການຄວບຄຸມລະດັບສຽງ."

#. (itstool) path: term/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:79
msgid "<primary>top edge panel</primary> <secondary>window list icon</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ແຜງຂອບເທິງ</primary> <secondary>ໄອຄອນລາຍຊື່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:78
msgid "<_:indexterm-1/> <application>Window Selector</application> icon"
msgstr "<_:indexterm-1/> ໄອຄອນ <application>ຕົວເລືອກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ</application>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:84
msgid "The <application>Window Selector</application> lists all of your open windows. To give focus to a window, click on the window selector icon at the extreme right of the top edge panel, then select the window. For more on this, see <xref linkend=\"windows-focus\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<application>ຕົວເລືອກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ</application> ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທັງໝົດທີ່ເຈົ້າເປີດຢູ່. ເພື່ອເລືອ"
"ກໃຊ້ງານປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນຕົວເລືອກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຂວາສຸດຂອງແຜງຂອບເທິງ, ແລ້ວເລືອກປ່ອງຢ້ຽ"
"ມນັ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"windows-focus\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:91
msgid "Bottom Edge Panel"
msgstr "ແຜງຂອບລຸ່ມ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:94
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>bottom edge panel</secondary> <see>bottom edge panel</see>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ແຜງຂອບລຸ່ມ</secondary> <see>ແຜງຂອບລຸ່ມ</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:99
msgid "<primary>bottom edge panel</primary> <secondary>introduction</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງຂອບລຸ່ມ</primary> <secondary>ບົດນຳ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:103
msgid "By default, the bottom edge panel contains the following objects:"
msgstr "ຕາມມາດຕະຖານ, ແຜງຂອບລຸ່ມຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍວັດຖຸດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:105
msgid "<primary>bottom edge panel</primary> <secondary>default contents</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງຂອບລຸ່ມ</primary> <secondary>ເນື້ອຫາຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:111
msgid "<guibutton>Show Desktop</guibutton> button"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ສະແດງເດັສທັອບ</guibutton>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:112
msgid "Click on this button to minimize all open windows and show the desktop. Click it again to restore all the windows to their previous state."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມນີ້ເພື່ອຫຍໍ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທັງໝົດທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ລົງ ແລະ ສະແດງໜ້າເດັສທັອບ. ຄລິກອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອຄືນຄ່າປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທັງໝົດໃຫ້ກັບ"
"ມາສູ່ສະຖານະກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:115
msgid "<application>Window List</application> applet"
msgstr "ແອັບເພັດ <application>ລາຍຊື່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ (Window List)</application>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:116
msgid "Displays a button for each window that is open. The <application>Window List</application> enables you to minimize and restore windows. For more on this, see <xref linkend=\"windowlist\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງປຸ່ມສຳລັບແຕ່ລະປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ເປີດຢູ່. <application>ລາຍຊື່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ</application> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າ ສາ"
"ມາດຫຍໍ້ ແລະ ຄືນຄ່າປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"windowlist\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:119
msgid "<application>Workspace Switcher</application> applet"
msgstr ""
"ແອັບເພັດ <application>ຕົວສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ (Workspace Switcher)</application>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:120
msgid "Enables you to switch between your workspaces. For more on workspaces, see <xref linkend=\"overview-workspaces\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດສະຫຼັບໄປມາລະຫວ່າງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ, ເບິ່"
"ງ <xref linkend=\"overview-workspaces\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:126
msgid "Managing Panels"
msgstr "ການຈັດການແຜງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:130
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>managing</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ການຈັດການ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:134
msgid "The following sections describe how to manage your panels."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆ ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຈັດການແຜງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:135
msgid "To interact with a panel, you must click on a vacant space on the panel rather than on any of the objects it holds. If the hide buttons are visible on the panel, you can also middle-click or right-click on one of them to select the panel."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕອບໂຕ້ກັບແຜງ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຄລິກໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງເທິງແຜງ ແທນທີ່ຈະຄລິກໃສ່ວັດຖຸໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງນັ້ນ. ຫາກເຫັນປຸ່ມເຊື່"
"ອງຢູ່ເທິງແຜງ, ເຈົ້າກໍສາມາດຄລິກກາງ ຫຼື ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອເລືອກແຜງນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:137
msgid "Moving a Panel"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍແຜງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:138
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>moving</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ການຍ້າຍ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:142
msgid "To move a panel to another side of the screen, press and hold <keycap>ALT</keycap> and drag the panel to its new location. Click on any vacant space on the panel to begin the drag."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຍ້າຍແຜງໄປຍັງອີກດ້ານໜຶ່ງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ໃຫ້ກົດ <keycap>ALT</keycap> ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລ້ວລາກແຜງໄປຍັງສະຖາ"
"ນທີ່ໃໝ່. ຄລິກໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງໃດໜຶ່ງເທິງແຜງເພື່ອເລີ່ມການລາກ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:143
msgid "A panel that is not set to expand to the full width of the screen can be dragged away from the edge of the screen and placed anywhere. See <xref linkend=\"panel-properties\"/> for details on how to set a panel's expand property."
msgstr ""
"ແຜງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍເຕັມຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ສາມາດລາກອອກຈາກຂອບໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ວາງໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້. "
"ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"panel-properties\"/> ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຕັ້ງຄ່າການຂະຫຍາຍຂອງແ"
"ຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:146
msgid "Panel Properties"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງແຜງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:149
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>modifying properties</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ການປັບປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:153
msgid "You can change the properties of each panel, such as the position of the panel, the hide behavior, and the visual appearance."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງແຕ່ລະແຜງໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ: ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງແຜງ, ພຶດຕິກຳການເຊື່ອງ, ແລະ ຮູບລັກສະນະ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:156
msgid "To modify the properties of a panel, right-click on a vacant space on the panel, then choose <guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem>. The <guilabel>Panel Properties</guilabel> dialog contains two tabbed sections, <guilabel>General</guilabel> and <guilabel>Background</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປັບປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງແຜງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງເທິງແຜງ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ຄຸນສົມບັດ</"
"guimenuitem>. ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງແຜງ</guilabel> ຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງແຖບຄື: "
"<guilabel>ທົ່ວໄປ (General)</guilabel> ແລະ <guilabel>ພື້ນຫຼັງ (Background)</"
"guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:158
msgid "General Properties Tab"
msgstr "ແຖບຄຸນສົມບັດທົ່ວໄປ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:159
msgid "In the <guilabel>General</guilabel> tab, you can modify panel size, position, and hiding properties. The following table describes the dialog elements on the <guilabel>General</guilabel> tabbed section:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຖບ <guilabel>ທົ່ວໄປ</guilabel>, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ, ຕຳແໜ່ງ, ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດການເຊື່ອງ"
"ຂອງແຜງໄດ້. ຕາຕະລາງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆ ໃນແຖບ <guilabel>ທົ່ວໄປ</guilabel>"
":"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:178
msgid "<guilabel>Orientation</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ທິດທາງ (Orientation)</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:183
msgid "Select the position of the panel on your screen. Click on the required position for the panel."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງແຜງເທິງໜ້າຈໍ. ຄລິກທີ່ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການສຳລັບແຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:194
msgid "Use the spin box to specify the size of the panel."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ກ່ອງປັບຄ່າ (spin box) ເພື່ອລະບຸຂະໜາດຂອງແຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:199
msgid "<guilabel>Expand</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຂະຫຍາຍ (Expand)</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:204
msgid "By default, a panel expands to the full length of the edge of the screen where it is located. A panel that does not expand can be moved away from the screen edges to any part of the screen."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມມາດຕະຖານ, ແຜງຈະຂະຫຍາຍເຕັມຄວາມຍາວຂອງຂອບໜ້າຈໍບ່ອນທີ່ມັນຕັ້ງຢູ່. ແຜງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຂະຫຍາຍ ສາມາດຍ້າຍອ"
"ອກຈາກຂອບໜ້າຈໍໄປໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:209
msgid "<guilabel>Autohide</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ເຊື່ອງອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Autohide)</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:214
msgid "Select this option if you want the panel to only be fully visible when the mouse pointer is over it. The panel hides off-screen along its longest edge, leaving a narrow part visible along the edge of the desktop. Move the mouse pointer over the visible part of the panel to make it move back into view."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ແຜງສະແດງອອກມາທັງໝົດເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງມັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ແຜງຈະເຊື່"
"ອງຕົວອອກນອກໜ້າຈໍຕາມຂອບທີ່ຍາວທີ່ສຸດຂອງມັນ, ໂດຍປະສ່ວນແຄບໆ ໄວ້ໃຫ້ເຫັນຕາມຂອບເດັສທັອບ. ເລື່ອນເມົ້າໄປໃ"
"ສ່ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫັນນັ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຜງກັບຄືນມາສະແດງຄືເກົ່າ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:219
#: C/gospanel.xml:1442
msgid "<guilabel>Show hide buttons</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ສະແດງປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:224
msgid "Select this option to display hide buttons at each end of your panel. Clicking on a hide button moves the panel lenthways, hiding it off-screen except for the hide button at the opposite end. Click this hide button to restore the panel to being fully visible."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງຢູ່ແຕ່ລະສົ້ນຂອງແຜງ. ການຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງຈະຍ້າຍແຜງໄປຕາມລວງຍາວ ແລະ "
"ເຊື່ອງມັນໄວ້ນອກໜ້າຈໍ ເຫຼືອໄວ້ພຽງແຕ່ປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງຢູ່ອີກສົ້ນໜຶ່ງ. ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງນັ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຜງກັບຄືນມາສະແດງທັງໝົດ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:230
#: C/gospanel.xml:1453
msgid "<guilabel>Arrows on hide buttons</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ລູກສອນເທິງປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:235
msgid "Select this option to display arrows on the hide buttons, if the hide button is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງລູກສອນເທິງປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງ, ຫາກມີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:244
msgid "Background Properties Tab"
msgstr "ແຖບຄຸນສົມບັດພື້ນຫຼັງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:245
msgid "You can choose the type of background for the panel in the <guilabel>Background</guilabel> tab. The choices are as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກປະເພດພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບແຜງໄດ້ໃນແຖບ <guilabel>ພື້ນຫຼັງ</guilabel>. ຕົວເລືອກມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:263
msgid "<guilabel>None (use system theme)</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ບໍ່ມີ (ໃຊ້ທີມຂອງລະບົບ)</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:268
msgid "Select this option to have the panel use the settings in the <xref linkend=\"prefs-theme\"/> tool. This keeps your panel's background looking the same as the rest of the desktop and applications."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຜງໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນເຄື່ອງມື <xref linkend=\"prefs-theme\"/>. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດ"
"ໃຫ້ພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງແຜງຄືກັນກັບສ່ວນອື່ນໆ ຂອງເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:273
msgid "<guilabel>Solid color</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ສີພື້ນ (Solid color)</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:278
msgid "Select this option to specify a single color for the panel background. Click on the <guibutton>Color</guibutton> button to display the color selector dialog. Choose the color that you require from the color selector dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸສີດຽວສຳລັບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງແຜງ. ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ສີ</guibutton> ເພື່ອສະແດງ"
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບການເລືອກສີ. ເລືອກສີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈາກກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:282
msgid "Use the <guilabel>Style</guilabel> slider to specify the degree of transparency or opaqueness for the color. For example, to make the panel transparent, move the slider to the <guilabel>Transparent</guilabel> end."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນ <guilabel>ຮູບແບບ (Style)</guilabel> ເພື່ອລະບຸລະດັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ ຫຼື ຄວາມທຶບແສງຂ"
"ອງສີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ແຜງໂປ່ງໃສ, ໃຫ້ເລື່ອນແຖບໄປທາງດ້ານ <guilabel>ໂປ່ງໃສ (Transparent)"
"</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:289
msgid "<guilabel>Background image</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ຮູບພື້ນຫຼັງ</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:294
msgid "Select this option to specify an image for the panel background. Click on the button to browse for an image file. When you have selected the file, click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຮູບພາບສຳລັບພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງແຜງ. ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມເພື່ອຊອກຫາໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ. ເມື່ອເລືອກໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ແລ້"
"ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <guibutton>ຕົກລົງ (OK)</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:304
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>changing background</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ການປ່ຽນພື້ນຫຼັງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:311
msgid "You can also drag a color or image on to a panel to set the color or image as the background of the panel. You can drag a color or image from many applications. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດລາກສີ ຫຼື ຮູບພາບໄປວາງໃສ່ແຜງເພື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງແຜງໄດ້ນຳ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດລາກສີ ຫຼື ຮູບພາບມ"
"າຈາກຫຼາຍໆ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:316
msgid "You can drag a color from any color selector dialog."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລາກສີມາຈາກກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບການເລືອກສີໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:319
msgid "You can drag an image file from the <application>Caja</application> file manager to set it as the background of the panel."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດລາກໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບຈາກຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ <application>Caja</application> ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງ"
"ຂອງແຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:322
msgid "You can drag a color or a pattern from the <guilabel>Backgrounds and Emblems</guilabel> dialog (see <xref linkend=\"caja-backgrounds-and-emblems\"/>) in <application>Caja</application> file manager to a panel to set it as the background."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດລາກສີ ຫຼື ລວດລາຍມາຈາກກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ພື້ນຫຼັງ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ (Backgrounds "
"and Emblems)</guilabel> (ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"caja-backgrounds-and-"
"emblems\"/>) ໃນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ <application>Caja</application> ໄປຍັງແຜງເພື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງ"
"ໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:326
msgid "Click <guibutton>Close</guibutton> to close the <guilabel>Panel Properties</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ <guibutton>ປິດ (Close)</guibutton> ເພື່ອປິດກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງແຜງ</"
"guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:330
msgid "Hiding a Panel"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອງແຜງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:331
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>hiding</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ການເຊື່ອງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:335
msgid "You can hide or show a panel if it has hide buttons. If the hide buttons are not visible on a panel, modify the panel properties so that the hide buttons are visible."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຊື່ອງ ຫຼື ສະແດງແຜງໄດ້ຫາກມັນມີປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງ. ຫາກປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງບໍ່ປາກົດຢູ່ເທິງແຜງ, ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອ"
"ງແຜງເພື່ອໃຫ້ປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງປາກົດອອກມາ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:338
msgid "Hide buttons are at either end of a panel. The hide buttons contain an optional arrow icon. The following illustration shows hide buttons."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງຈະຢູ່ທີ່ສົ້ນໃດສົ້ນໜຶ່ງຂອງແຜງ. ປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງຈະມີໄອຄອນລູກສອນ (ເລືອກໄດ້). ຮູບພາບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນປຸ່ມ"
"ເຊື່ອງ."

