"ທັງສອງມີປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງ.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:350
msgid "To hide a panel, click on one of the hide buttons. The panel shrinks in the direction of the arrow on the hide button. The hide button at the other end of the panel remains visible."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຊື່ອງແຜງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງ. ແຜງຈະຫົດຕົວໄປຕາມທິດທາງຂອງລູກສອນເທິງປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງ. ສ່ວນປຸ່ມເຊື່"
"ອງຢູ່ອີກສົ້ນໜຶ່ງຂອງແຜງຈະຍັງຄົງປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:353
msgid "To show a hidden panel again, click on the visible hide button. The panel expands in the direction of the arrow on the hide button. Both hide buttons are now visible."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສະແດງແຜງທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງທີ່ເຫັນຢູ່ນັ້ນ. ແຜງຈະຂະຫຍາຍອອກໄປຕາມທິດທາງຂອງລູກສ"
"ອນເທິງປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງ. ຕອນນີ້ປຸ່ມເຊື່ອງທັງສອງຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:356
msgid "You can set a panel to autohide. When you set autohide, the panel hides automatically when the mouse is not pointing to the panel. The panel reappears when you point to the part of the screen where the panel resides. To set your panel to autohide, modify the properties of the panel as per the instructions in <xref linkend=\"panel-properties\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ແຜງເຊື່ອງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້. ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຜງຈະເຊື່ອງຕົວເອງເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້"
"ເອົາເມົ້າໄປຊີ້ໃສ່ແຜງ. ແຜງຈະປາກົດຄືນມາເມື່ອເຈົ້າເອົາເມົ້າໄປຊີ້ໃສ່ ສ່ວນຂອງໜ້າຈໍທີ່ແຜງນັ້ນຕັ້ງຢູ່. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າແຜງ"
"ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງແຜງ ຕາມຄຳແນະນຳໃນ <xref linkend=\"panel-"
"properties\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:362
msgid "Adding a New Panel"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມແຜງໃໝ່"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:363
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>adding new</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ການເພີ່ມໃໝ່</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:367
msgid "To add a panel, right-click on a vacant space on any panel, then choose <guimenuitem>New Panel</guimenuitem>. The new panel is added to the MATE Desktop. The new panel contains no objects. You can customize the new panel to suit your preferences."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແຜງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງເທິງແຜງໃດກໍໄດ້, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ແຜງໃໝ່ (New "
"Panel)</guimenuitem>. ແຜງໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນເດັສທັອບ MATE. ແຜງໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະຍັງບໍ່ມີວັດຖຸໃດໆ. ເຈົ້າສາ"
"ມາດປັບແຕ່ງແຜງໃໝ່ນີ້ໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:372
msgid "Deleting a Panel"
msgstr "ການລຶບແຜງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:375
msgid "<primary>panels</primary> <secondary>deleting</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ການລຶບ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:379
msgid "To delete a panel from the MATE Desktop, right-click on the panel that you want to delete, then choose <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Delete This Panel</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
