#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:537
msgid "Moving a Panel Object"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:538
msgid "<primary>panel objects</primary> <secondary>moving</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ການຍ້າຍ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:542
msgid "You can move panel objects within a panel, and from one panel to another panel. You can also move objects between panels and drawers."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຍ້າຍວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງພາຍໃນແຜງດຽວກັນ, ຫຼື ຍ້າຍຈາກແຜງໜຶ່ງໄປຍັງອີກແຜງໜຶ່ງໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດ"
"ຍ້າຍວັດຖຸລະຫວ່າງແຜງ ແລະ ລີ້ນຊັກໄດ້ນຳ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:544
msgid "To move a panel object, middle-click and hold on the object and drag the object to a new location. When you release the middle mouse button, the object anchors at the new location."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຍ້າຍວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກກາງຄ້າງໄວ້ໃສ່ວັດຖຸ ແລ້ວລາກໄປຍັງສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່. ເມື່ອປ່ອຍປຸ່ມເມົ້າກາງ, ວັດຖຸຈະ"
"ຖືກວາງລົງໃນສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:547
msgid "Alternatively, you can use the panel object popup menu to move an object, as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼືອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ເມນູປ໊ອບອັບຂອງວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງເພື່ອຍ້າຍວັດຖຸໄດ້ ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:551
msgid "Right-click on the object, then choose <guimenuitem>Move</guimenuitem>."
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ວັດຖຸ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ຍ້າຍ</guimenuitem>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:554
msgid "Point to the new location for the object, then click any mouse button to anchor the object to the new location. This location can be on any panel that is currently in the MATE Desktop."
msgstr ""
"ຊີ້ໄປຍັງສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່ສຳລັບວັດຖຸ, ແລ້ວຄລິກປຸ່ມເມົ້າໃດກໍໄດ້ເພື່ອວາງວັດຖຸລົງໃນສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່. ສະຖານທີ່ນີ້ສາມາດເປັນແ"
"ຜງໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເດັສທັອບ MATE."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:559
msgid "Movement of a panel object affects the position of other objects on the panel. To control how objects move on a panel, you can specify a movement mode. To specify the movement mode, press one of the following keys as you move the panel object:"
msgstr ""
"ການຍ້າຍວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸອື່ນໆ ໃນແຜງນັ້ນ. ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຮູບແບບການຍ້າຍ ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸ"
"ໂໝດການຍ້າຍໄດ້. ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍ້າຍວັດຖຸ:"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:571
msgid "Key"
msgstr "ຄີ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:574
msgid "Movement Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຍ້າຍ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:584
msgid "No key"
msgstr "ບໍ່ກົດປຸ່ມໃດໆ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:587
msgid "Switched movement"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍແບບສະຫຼັບທີ່"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:590
msgid "The object swaps places with other panel objects. Switched movement is the default movement mode."
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸຈະສະຫຼັບບ່ອນກັບວັດຖຸອື່ນໆ ເທິງແຜງ. ການຍ້າຍແບບສະຫຼັບທີ່ແມ່ນໂໝດມາດຕະຖານ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:596
msgid "<keycap>Alt</keycap> key"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ <keycap>Alt</keycap>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:599
msgid "Free movement"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍແບບອິດສະຫຼະ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:602
msgid "The object jumps over other panel objects into the next vacant space on the panel."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຈະໂດດຂ້າມວັດຖຸອື່ນໆ ໄປຍັງພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງຖັດໄປໃນແຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:608
msgid "<keycap>Shift</keycap> key"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ <keycap>Shift</keycap>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:611
msgid "Push movement"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍແບບຊຸກ"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:614
msgid "The object pushes other panel objects further along the panel."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸຈະຊຸກວັດຖຸອື່ນໆ ໃຫ້ເລື່ອນອອກໄປຕາມແຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:623
msgid "Locking a Panel Object"
msgstr "ການລັອກວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງ"

