#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:702
msgid "You might use a launcher to do any of the following:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າອາດຈະໃຊ້ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:705
msgid "Start a particular application."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:708
msgid "Execute a command."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:711
msgid "Open a folder."
msgstr "ເປີດໂຟນເດີ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:714
msgid "Open a Web browser at a particular page on the Web."
msgstr "ເປີດເວັບບຣາວເຊີໄປຍັງໜ້າເວັບໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. (itstool) path: para/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:719
msgid "<primary>special URI locations</primary><secondary>and launchers</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ສະຖານທີ່ URI ພິເສດ</primary><secondary>ແລະ ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:717
msgid "Open special <firstterm>Uniform Resource Identifiers</firstterm> (URIs). The MATE Desktop contains special URIs that enable you to access particular functions from the file manager. <_:indexterm-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <firstterm>ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຊັບພະຍາກອນມາດຕະຖານ (URIs)</firstterm> ແບບພິເສດ. ເດັສທັອບ "
"MATE ປະກອບດ້ວຍ URIs ພິເສດທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຂົ້າເຖິງການເຮັດວຽກບາງຢ່າງໄດ້ຈາກຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌. "
"<_:indexterm-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:724
msgid "You can modify the properties of a launcher. For example, the properties of a launcher include the name of the launcher, the icon that represents the launcher, and how the launcher runs. For more on this, see <xref linkend=\"launchers-modify\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ລວມມີ ຊື່ຂອງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້, ໄອຄ"
"ອນທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້, ແລະ ວິທີທີ່ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ເຮັດວຽກ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"launchers-modify\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:727
msgid "In certain situations, a launcher in a menu might not show an icon. For example, if it specifies no icon to display, or if the entire menu is set to show no icons."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ, ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ໃນເມນູອາດຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໄອຄອນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກບໍ່ມີການລະບຸໄອຄອນໃຫ້ສະແດ"
"ງ, ຫຼື ຫາກເມນູທັງໝົດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍ່ໃຫ້ສະແດງໄອຄອນ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:731
msgid "Adding a Launcher to a Panel"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:732
msgid "<primary>launchers</primary> <secondary>adding to panel</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້</primary> <secondary>ການເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:736
msgid "You can add a launcher to a panel in one of the following ways:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ເຂົ້າໃນແຜງໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:740
#: C/gospanel.xml:1354
msgid "From the panel popup menu"
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູປ໊ອບອັບຂອງແຜງ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:741
msgid "Right-click on any vacant space on the panel, then choose <guimenu>Add to Panel</guimenu>. The <guilabel>Add to Panel</guilabel> dialog opens (see <xref linkend=\"panels-addobject\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງເທິງແຜງ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <guimenu>ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ</guimenu>. ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ "
"<guilabel>ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ</guilabel> ຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນ (ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"panels-"
"addobject\"/>)."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:743
msgid "To create a new launcher, select <guilabel>Custom Application Launcher</guilabel> from the list. A <guilabel>Create Launcher</guilabel> dialog is displayed. For more information on the properties in this dialog, see <xref linkend=\"launchers-properties\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <guilabel>ກຳນົດຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເອງ</guilabel> ຈາກລາຍກາ"
"ນ. ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ສ້າງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້</guilabel> ຈະສະແດງອອກມາ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄຸ"
"ນສົມບັດໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"launchers-properties\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:746
msgid "Alternatively, to add an existing launcher to the panel, select <guilabel>Application Launcher</guilabel> from the list. Choose the launcher that you want to add from the list of menu items."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼືອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <guilabel>ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</"
"guilabel> ຈາກລາຍການ. ແລ້ວເລືອກຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈາກລາຍການເມນູ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:750
#: C/gospanel.xml:1366
msgid "From any menu"
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູໃດກໍໄດ້"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:751
msgid "To add a launcher to a panel from a menu, perform one of the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ເຂົ້າໃນແຜງຈາກເມນູ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:754
msgid "Open a menu that contains the launcher. Drag the launcher on to the panel."
msgstr "ເປີດເມນູທີ່ມີຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ນັ້ນຢູ່. ແລ້ວລາກຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ນັ້ນໄປວາງໃສ່ແຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:756
msgid "Open the menu that contains the launcher and right-click on the title of the launcher. Choose <guimenuitem>Add this launcher to panel</guimenuitem>. This method will only work if the launcher is on a sub-menu of the menu that you opened."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດເມນູທີ່ມີຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ນັ້ນຢູ່ ແລ້ວຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊື່ຂອງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້. ເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ເພີ່ມຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນ"
"ແຜງ</guimenuitem>. ວິທີນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນເມນູຍ່ອຍຂອງເມນູທີ່ເຈົ້າເປີດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:761
msgid "From the file manager"
msgstr "ຈາກຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:762
msgid "To add a launcher to a panel from the file manager, find the <filename>.desktop</filename> file for the launcher in your file system, then drag the <filename>.desktop</filename> file to the panel."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ເຂົ້າໃນແຜງຈາກຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາໄຟລ໌ <filename>.desktop</filename> "
"ສຳລັບຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ນັ້ນໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລ້ວລາກໄຟລ໌ <filename>.desktop</filename> ນັ້ນໄປວາງ"
"ໃສ່ແຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:767
msgid "Modifying a Launcher"
msgstr "ການປັບປ່ຽນຕົວເປີດໃຊ້"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:770
msgid "<primary>launchers</primary> <secondary>modifying properties</secondary>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້</primary> <secondary>ການປັບປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:774
msgid "To modify the properties of a launcher in a panel, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ໃນແຜງ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:778
msgid "Right-click on the launcher to open the panel object popup menu."
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດເມນູປ໊ອບອັບຂອງວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:782
msgid "Choose <guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem>. Use the <guilabel>Launcher Properties</guilabel> dialog to modify the properties as required. For more information on the <guilabel>Launcher Properties</guilabel> dialog, see <xref linkend=\"launchers-properties\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ <guimenuitem>ຄຸນສົມບັດ</guimenuitem>. ໃຊ້ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວເປີດໃ"
"ຊ້</guilabel> ເພື່ອປັບປ່ຽນຄຸນສົມບັດຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ "
"<guilabel>ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້</guilabel>, ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"launchers-"
"properties\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:787
msgid "Click <guibutton>Close</guibutton> to close the <guilabel>Launcher Properties</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ <guibutton>ປິດ (Close)</guibutton> ເພື່ອປິດກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວເປີດໃ"
"ຊ້</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:792
msgid "Launcher Properties"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຕົວເປີດໃຊ້"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:796
msgid "When you create or edit a launcher, the following properties can be set:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຕົວເປີດໃຊ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນສົມບັດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:800
msgid "Use the drop-down list to specify whether this launcher starts an application or opens a location:"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ນີ້ຈະເລີ່ມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ເປີດສະຖານທີ່:"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:802
msgid "Application"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:804
msgid "The launcher starts an application."
msgstr "ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ຈະເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gospanel.xml:807
msgid "Application in Terminal"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃນເທີມິນໍ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:809
msgid "The launcher starts an application through a terminal window."
msgstr "ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ຈະເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຜ່ານປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເທີມິນໍ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:814
msgid "The launcher opens a file, web page or other location."
msgstr "ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ຈະເປີດໄຟລ໌, ໜ້າເວັບ ຫຼື ສະຖານທີ່ອື່ນໆ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:818
msgid "If you are editing a location launcher, this drop-down list will not be displayed. If you are editing an application launcher, the <guilabel>Location</guilabel> option will not be available."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ສະຖານທີ່, ລາຍການແບບເລື່ອນລົງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ. ຫາກເຈົ້າກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຕົວເປີດໃຊ້ແ"
"ອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ຕົວເລືອກ <guilabel>ສະຖານທີ່</guilabel> ຈະບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:825
