#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1267
msgid "You can add the following types of menu to your panels:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມເມນູປະເພດຕ່າງໆ ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນແຜງຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1270
msgid "<guimenu>Classic Menu</guimenu>: You can access almost all the standard applications, commands, and configuration options from the menus in the Classic Menu. It contains the <guimenu>Applications</guimenu>, <guimenu>Places</guimenu>, and <guimenu>System</guimenu> menus."
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>ເມນູແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (Classic Menu)</guimenu>: ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນມາດຕະຖາ"
"ນ, ຄຳສັ່ງ, ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າເກືອບທັງໝົດໄດ້ຈາກເມນູໃນ ເມນູແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍເມນູ "
"<guimenu>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guimenu>, <guimenu>ສະຖານທີ່</guimenu>, ແລະ <guimenu>ລະບົບ</"
"guimenu>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1274
msgid "To add a <guimenu>Classic Menu</guimenu> to a panel, right-click on any vacant space on the panel. Choose <guimenu>Add to Panel</guimenu>, then choose <application>Classic Menu</application> from the Add to Panel dialog. See <xref linkend=\"panels-addobject\"/> for more on this."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ <guimenu>ເມນູແບບດັ້ງເດີມ</guimenu> ເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງເທິງແຜງ. ເລືອ"
"ກ <guimenu>ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ</guimenu>, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <application>ເມນູແບບດັ້ງເດີມ</"
"application> ຈາກກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ. ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"panels-addobject\"/> ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມ"
"ເຕີມ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1280
msgid "<guimenu>Compact Menu</guimenu>: The Compact Menu contains the same items as the Classic Menu, but organizes them into one menu instead of three. It takes up less space on the panels as a result."
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>ເມນູແບບຫຍໍ້ (Compact Menu)</guimenu>: ເມນູແບບຫຍໍ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍການດຽວກັນກັບເມນູແ"
"ບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ແຕ່ຖືກຈັດລຽງລວມກັນຢູ່ໃນເມນູດຽວແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນສາມເມນູ. ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມັນໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ເທິງແຜງໜ້ອຍລົງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1283
msgid "To add a <guimenu>Compact Menu</guimenu> to a panel, right-click on any vacant space on the panel. Choose <guimenu>Add to Panel</guimenu>, then choose <application>Compact Menu</application> from the Add to Panel dialog. See <xref linkend=\"panels-addobject\"/> for more on this."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ <guimenu>ເມນູແບບຫຍໍ້</guimenu> ເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງເທິງແຜງ. ເລືອກ "
"<guimenu>ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ</guimenu>, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <application>ເມນູແບບຫຍໍ້</application> ຈ"
"າກກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ. ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"panels-addobject\"/> ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1289
msgid "<guimenu>Submenus</guimenu>: You can add a submenu of the Classic Menu or Compact Menu directly to the panel. For example, you can add the <guimenu>Games</guimenu> submenu of the <guimenu>Applications</guimenu> menu to the panel."
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>ເມນູຍ່ອຍ (Submenus)</guimenu>: ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມເມນູຍ່ອຍຂອງເມນູແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ຫຼື ເມນູແບ"
"ບຫຍໍ້ ເຂົ້າໃນແຜງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມເມນູຍ່ອຍ <guimenu>ເກມ (Games)</guimenu> "
"ຈາກເມນູ <guimenu>ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guimenu> ເຂົ້າໃນແຜງໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1292
msgid "To add a submenu to a panel, open the submenu, right-click on a launcher, then choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Entire menu</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add this as menu to panel</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມເມນູຍ່ອຍເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ, ໃຫ້ເປີດເມນູຍ່ອຍນັ້ນ, ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້, ແລ້ວເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>ເມນູທັງໝົດ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເພີ່ມສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນເມນູເຂົ້າໃນແຜງ</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gospanel.xml:1298
msgid "Drawers"
msgstr "ລີ້ນຊັກ (Drawers)"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gospanel.xml:1299
msgid "<primary>panel objects</primary> <secondary>drawers</secondary> <see>drawers</see>"
msgstr ""
"<primary>ວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງ</primary> <secondary>ລີ້ນຊັກ</secondary> <see>ລີ້ນຊັກ</see>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1304
msgid "A drawer is an extension of a panel. You can open and close a drawer in the same way that you can show and hide a panel. A drawer can contain all panel objects, including launchers, menus, applets, and other drawers. When you open a drawer, you can use the objects in the same way that you use objects on a panel."
msgstr ""
"ລີ້ນຊັກ ແມ່ນສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງແຜງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດ ແລະ ປິດລີ້ນຊັກໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບ ການສະແດງ ແລະ "
"ເຊື່ອງແຜງ. ລີ້ນຊັກສາມາດບັນຈຸວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງໄດ້ທຸກຊະນິດ, ລວມມີ ຕົວເປີດໃຊ້, ເມນູ, ແອັບເພັດ, ແລະ ລີ້ນຊັກອື່ນ"
"ໆ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເປີດລີ້ນຊັກ, ເຈົ້າກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ງານວັດຖຸ ໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບດຽວກັນກັບການໃຊ້ວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1309
msgid "The following figure shows an open drawer that contains two panel objects."
msgstr "ຮູບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນລີ້ນຊັກທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸວັດຖຸເທິງແຜງສອງອັນ."

