msgstr "<guilabel>ໄອຄອນ (Icon)</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: entry/para
#: C/gospanel.xml:1435
msgid "Choose an icon to represent the drawer. Click on the <guibutton>Icon</guibutton> button to display an icon selector dialog. Choose an icon from the dialog and click <guibutton>OK</guibutton> to confirm your choice."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກໄອຄອນເພື່ອສະແດງເຖິງລີ້ນຊັກ. ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ໄອຄອນ</guibutton> ເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອ"
"ບການເລືອກໄອຄອນ. ເລືອກໄອຄອນຈາກກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບແລ້ວຄລິກ <guibutton>ຕົກລົງ (OK)</guibutton> ເພື່"
"ອຢືນຢັນການເລືອກ."

