msgstr ""
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ລັອກໜ້າຈໍ</guibutton> ຈະບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແຜງຄວບຄຸມ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໄປ, "
"ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ <xref linkend=\"panels-addobject\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:172
msgid "To unlock the screen, move your mouse or press any key, enter your password in the locked screen dialog, then press <keycap>Return</keycap>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປົດລັອກໜ້າຈໍ, ໃຫ້ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງ, ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງທ່ານໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຖືກລັອກ, ແລ້ວກົ"
"ດ <keycap>Return</keycap> (ຫຼື Enter)."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:173
msgid "If another user wants to use the computer while it is locked, they can move the mouse or press a key and then click <guibutton>Switch User</guibutton>. The login screen will be displayed, and they can log in using their user account. They will not be able to access any of your applications or information. When they log out, the screen will be locked again and you can access your session by unlocking the screen."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຄອມພິວເຕີໃນຂະນະທີ່ມັນຖືກລັອກຢູ່, ເຂົາເຈົ້າສາມາດເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງ ແລ້ວຄລິກ "
"<guibutton>ສະຫຼັບຜູ້ໃຊ້</guibutton>. ໜ້າຈໍເຂົ້າລະບົບຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ, ແລະ ເຂົາເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າລະບົບ"
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້. ເຂົາເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ເມື່ອເຂົາ"
"ເຈົ້າອອກຈາກລະບົບ, ໜ້າຈໍຈະຖືກລັອກຄືນຄືເກົ່າ ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊດຊັນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ໂດຍການປົດລັອກໜ້າ"
"ຈໍ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:174
msgid "You can leave a message for a user who has locked their screen. Move the mouse or press any key and then click <guibutton>Leave Message</guibutton>. Type your message into the box and press <guibutton>Save</guibutton>. Your message will be displayed when the user unlocks their screen."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຝາກຂໍ້ຄວາມໄວ້ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ລັອກໜ້າຈໍຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າໄດ້. ໃຫ້ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງ ແລ້ວຄລິກ "
"<guibutton>ຝາກຂໍ້ຄວາມ</guibutton>. ພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງທ່ານໃສ່ໃນກ່ອງ ແລ້ວກົດ <guibutton>ບັນທຶກ</"
"guibutton>. ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງທ່ານຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປົດລັອກໜ້າຈໍຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:177
msgid "Setting Programs to Start Automatically When You Log In"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣແກຣມໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າລະບົບ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:182
msgid "<primary>sessions</primary> <secondary>startup</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ເຊດຊັນ</primary> <secondary>ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:186
msgid "You can choose for certain programs to be started automatically when you log in to a session. For example, you might want a web browser to be started as soon as you log in. Programs which start automatically when you log in are called <firstterm>startup programs</firstterm>. Startup programs are automatically saved and safely closed by the session manager when you log out, and are restarted when you log in."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໃຫ້ບາງໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າລະບົບ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃ"
"ຫ້ຕົວທ່ອງເວັບເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກທັນທີທີ່ທ່ານເຂົ້າລະບົບ. ໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າລະບົບເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"<firstterm>ໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</firstterm>. ໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຖືກບັນທຶກ ແລະ ປິດຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍຕົວ"
"ຈັດການເຊດຊັນເມື່ອທ່ານອອກຈາກລະບົບ, ແລະ ຈະຖືກເລີ່ມໃໝ່ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າລະບົບ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:192
msgid "The <application>Sessions</application> preference tool allows you to define which programs are started automatically when you log in. It has two tabs, the <guilabel>Startup Programs</guilabel> tab and the <guilabel>Options</guilabel> tab."
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງມືການຕັ້ງຄ່າ <application>ເຊດຊັນ</application> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດໄດ້ວ່າໂປຣແກຣມໃດຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້"
"ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າລະບົບ. ມັນມີສອງແທັບ ຄື: ແທັບ <guilabel>ໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</"
"guilabel> ແລະ ແທັບ <guilabel>ຕົວເລືອກ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:197
msgid "Startup Programs Tab"
msgstr "ແທັບໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:201
msgid "You can use the Startup Programs tab to add, modify, and remove startup programs."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ແທັບໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອເພີ່ມ, ແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:203
msgid "A list of startup programs is displayed on this tab. The list shows a short description of each program, along with a checkbox which denotes whether the startup program is enabled or not. Programs which are not enabled will not be started automatically when you log in."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແທັບນີ້. ລາຍການຈະສະແດງຄຳອະທິບາຍສັ້ນໆຂອງແຕ່ລະໂປຣແກຣມ, ພ້"
"ອມກັບຊ່ອງໝາຍຕິກເຊິ່ງບົ່ງບອກວ່າໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນັ້ນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼືບໍ່. ໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຈະບໍ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າລະບົບ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:208
msgid "Enabling/Disabling Startup Programs"
msgstr "ການເປີດ/ປິດໃຊ້ງານໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:209
msgid "To enable a program to start up automatically, check the checkbox corresponding to that program."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເປີດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງໝາຍທີ່ກົງກັບໂປຣແກຣມນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:211
msgid "To disable a program from starting automatically, uncheck the checkbox."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປິດບໍ່ໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຫ້ເອົາເຄື່ອງໝາຍຕິກອອກຈາກຊ່ອງໝາຍ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:215
msgid "Adding A New Startup Program"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:216
msgid "To add a new startup program, perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:219
msgid "Click <guibutton>Add</guibutton>. This will open the <application>Add Startup Program</application> dialog box."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ <guibutton>ເພີ່ມ</guibutton>. ນີ້ຈະເປັນການເປີດກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <application>ເພີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມເ"
"ລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</application>."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:223
msgid "Use the <guilabel>Name</guilabel> text box to specify a name for the new startup program."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຊື່</guilabel> ເພື່ອກຳນົດຊື່ໃຫ້ກັບໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:227
msgid "Use the <guilabel>Command</guilabel> text box to specify the command which will invoke the application. For example, the command <userinput>pluma</userinput> will start the <application>Pluma Text Editor</application>. If you do not know the exact command, click <guibutton>Browse</guibutton> to choose the path of the command."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຄຳສັ່ງ</guilabel> ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄຳສັ່"
"ງ <userinput>pluma</userinput> ຈະເລີ່ມການທຳງານຂອງ <application>Pluma Text "
"Editor</application>. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຮູ້ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ແນ່ນອນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <guibutton>ທ່ອງເບິ່ງ</guibutton> "
"ເພື່ອເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:234
msgid "Enter a description of the application in the <guilabel>Comments</guilabel> text box. You will see this as the description of the program in the list of startup programs."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ <guilabel>ຄຳເຫັນ</guilabel>. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ເ"
"ປັນຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງໂປຣແກຣມໃນລາຍການໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: step/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:239
msgid "Click <guibutton>Add</guibutton>. The application will be added to the list of startup programs with its checkbox in the checked (enabled) state."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ <guibutton>ເພີ່ມ</guibutton>. ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ໂດຍມີກ"
"ານໝາຍຕິກ (ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ) ໄວ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:246
msgid "Removing A Startup Program"
msgstr "ການລຶບໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:247
msgid "To remove a startup program, select it from the list of startup programs and click <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລຶບໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກມັນຈາກລາຍການແລ້ວຄລິກ <guibutton>ລຶບອອກ</guibutton>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:251
msgid "Editing A Startup Program"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:252
msgid "To edit an existing startup program, select it from the list of startup programs and click <guibutton>Edit</guibutton>. A dialog will appear which allows you to edit the properties of the program. See <xref linkend=\"gosstartsession-212\"/> for more information on the options available in this dialog."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂໂປຣແກຣມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກມັນຈາກລາຍການແລ້ວຄລິກ <guibutton>ແກ້ໄຂ</guibutton>. "
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂປຣແກຣມ. ເບິ່ງ <xref "
"linkend=\"gosstartsession-212\"/> ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບນີ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:260
msgid "Session Options Tab"
msgstr "ແທັບຕົວເລືອກເຊດຊັນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:264
msgid "The session manager can remember which applications you have running when you log out and can automatically restart them when you log in again. If you would like this to happen every time you log out, check <guilabel>Automatically remember running applications when logging out</guilabel>. If you would like this to happen only once, click <guibutton>Remember Currently Running Application</guibutton> before logging out."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການເຊດຊັນສາມາດຈື່ໄດ້ວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃດທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່ຕອນທີ່ທ່ານອອກຈາກລະບົບ ແລະ ສາມາດເລີ່ມ"
"ພວກມັນຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າລະບົບອີກຄັ້ງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ອອກຈາກລະບົບ, "
"ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກ <guilabel>ຈື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອອອກຈາກລະບົບ</guilabel>. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນພຽງແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <guibutton>ຈື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັ"
"ນ</guibutton> ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອອກຈາກລະບົບ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:274
msgid "Ending a Session"
msgstr "ການສິ້ນສຸດເຊດຊັນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:277
msgid "<primary>sessions</primary> <secondary>ending</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ເຊດຊັນ</primary> <secondary>ການສິ້ນສຸດ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:281
msgid "<primary>sessions</primary> <secondary>logging out</secondary>"
msgstr "<primary>ເຊດຊັນ</primary> <secondary>ການອອກຈາກລະບົບ</secondary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:285
msgid "<primary>logging out</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>ການອອກຈາກລະບົບ</primary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:288
msgid "<primary>quit</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>ອອກ</primary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:291
msgid "<primary>shutdown</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>ປິດເຄື່ອງ</primary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:307
msgid "When you have finished using your computer, you can choose to do one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ຄອມພິວເຕີສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກເຮັດຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:310
msgid "Log out, leaving the computer ready for another user to begin working with it. To log out of MATE, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>System</guimenu><guimenuitem>Log Out <replaceable>username</replaceable></guimenuitem></menuchoice> ."
msgstr ""
"ອອກຈາກລະບົບ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄອມພິວເຕີພ້ອມສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ. ເພື່ອອອກຈາກ MATE, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>ລະບົບ</guimenu><guimenuitem>ອອກຈາກລະບົບ <replaceable>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃ"
"ຊ້</replaceable></guimenuitem></menuchoice> ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:313
msgid "Shut down your computer and switch off the power. To shut down, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>System</guimenu><guimenuitem>Shut Down</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and click <guibutton>Shut Down</guibutton> on the dialog that appears."
msgstr ""
"ປິດຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ປິດໄຟ. ເພື່ອປິດເຄື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ລະບົບ</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>ປິດເຄື່ອງ</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ແລ້ວຄລິກ <guibutton>ປິດເຄື່"
"ອງ</guibutton> ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບທີ່ສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:316
msgid "Depending on your computer's configuration, you can also <firstterm>Hibernate</firstterm> your computer. During hibernation, less power is used, but all the applications and documents that you have open are preserved and will still be open when you resume from hibernation. You can resume from hibernation by moving your mouse or pressing a key."
msgstr ""
"ອີງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດ <firstterm>ຈຳສີນ</firstterm> "
"(Hibernate) ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຈຳສີນ, ຈະມີການໃຊ້ພະລັງງານໜ້ອຍລົງ, ແຕ່ແອັບພລິເຄ"
"ຊັນ ແລະ ເອກະສານທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານເປີດໄວ້ຈະຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ ແລະ ຍັງຄົງເປີດຢູ່ເມື່ອທ່ານກັບມາໃຊ້ງານໃໝ່. ທ່ານສາ"
"ມາດກັບມາໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:321
msgid "Some vendors and distributors allow you to hibernate your computer in two ways, often called Hibernate and <firstterm>Suspend</firstterm>. Both of these will preserve your open files and applications, but one will switch off the power to your computer while the other will leave the computer running in a state that uses less power."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ຜະລິດ ແລະ ຜູ້ຈຳໜ່າຍບາງລາຍອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານພັກເຄື່ອງໄດ້ສອງວິທີ, ມັກຈະເອີ້ນວ່າ ຈຳສີນ (Hibernate) ແລ"
"ະ <firstterm>ພັກຊົ່ວຄາວ</firstterm> (Suspend). ທັງສອງວິທີນີ້ຈະເກັບຮັກສາໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັ"
"ນທີ່ທ່ານເປີດໄວ້, ແຕ່ວິທີໜຶ່ງຈະປິດໄຟຄອມພິວເຕີ ສ່ວນອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຄອມພິວເຕີເຮັດວຽກໃນສະຖານະທີ່ໃຊ້ພະລັງງ"
"ານໜ້ອຍລົງ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:324
msgid "When you end a session, applications with unsaved work will warn you. You can choose to save your work, or cancel the command to log out or shut down."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານສິ້ນສຸດເຊດຊັນ, ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ມີວຽກທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ບັນທຶກຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກບັນທຶກວຽກຂ"
"ອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກຄຳສັ່ງອອກຈາກລະບົບ ຫຼື ປິດເຄື່ອງກໍໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosstartsession.xml:326
msgid "Before you end a session, you might want to save your current settings so that you can restore the session later. In the <xref linkend=\"prefs-sessions\"/> tool, you can select an option to automatically save your current settings."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສິ້ນສຸດເຊດຊັນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຄືນຄ່າເຊດຊັນໄດ້"
"ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ໃນເຄື່ອງມື <xref linkend=\"prefs-sessions\"/>, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອບັນທຶ"
"ກການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gostools.xml:7
msgid "Tools and Utilities"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ ຢູທິລິຕີ້"

#. (itstool) path: highlights/para
#: C/gostools.xml:10
msgid "This section describes some tools and utilities in the MATE Desktop."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ ຢູທິລິຕີ້ບາງຢ່າງໃນ MATE Desktop."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gostools.xml:13
msgid "Running Applications"
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/indexterm
#: C/gostools.xml:16
msgid "<primary>Run Application dialog, using</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>ການໃຊ້ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</primary>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gostools.xml:19
msgid "The <guilabel>Run Application</guilabel> dialog gives you access to the command line. When you run a command in the <guilabel>Run Application</guilabel> dialog, you cannot receive output from the command."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guilabel> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງໄດ້. ເມື່ອທ່ານ"
"ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guilabel>, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນການສະແດງ"
"ອອກຈາກຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gostools.xml:24
msgid "To run a command from the command line perform the following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gostools.xml:31
msgid "From a panel"
msgstr "ຈາກແຜງຄວບຄຸມ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:32
msgid "You can add the <application>Run Application</application> button to any panel. See <xref linkend=\"panels-addobject\"/>. Click on the <guibutton>Run Application</guibutton> panel button to open the <guilabel>Run Application</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມປຸ່ມ <application>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</application> ໃສ່ແຜງຄວບຄຸມໃດກໍໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ "
"<xref linkend=\"panels-addobject\"/>. ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</"
"guibutton> ຢູ່ແຜງຄວບຄຸມເພື່ອເປີດກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: C/gostools.xml:35
msgid "Using shortcut keys"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດ"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:37
msgid "Press <keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>. You can change the shortcut keys that display the <guilabel>Run Application</guilabel> dialog in the <application><xref linkend=\"prefs-keyboard-shortcuts\"/></application> tool."
msgstr ""
"ກົດ <keycombo><keycap>Alt</keycap><keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນປຸ່"
"ມລັດທີ່ໃຊ້ສະແດງກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guilabel> ໄດ້ໃນເຄື່ອງມື "
"<application><xref linkend=\"prefs-keyboard-shortcuts\"/></application>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:28
msgid "Open the <guilabel>Run Application</guilabel> dialog in any of the following ways: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guilabel> ດ້ວຍວິທີໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງນີ້: "
"<_:variablelist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:46
msgid "The <guilabel>Run Application</guilabel> dialog is displayed."
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</guilabel> ຈະຖືກສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:49
msgid "Enter the command that you want to run in the blank field, or choose from the list of known applications."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນຊ່ອງວ່າງ, ຫຼື ເລືອກຈາກລາຍການແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:50
msgid "If you enter only the location of a file, an appropriate application will launch to open it. If you enter a web page address, your default web browser will open the page. Prefix the web page address with https://, as in https://mate-desktop.org."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານປ້ອນພຽງແຕ່ບ່ອນຢູ່ຂອງໄຟລ໌, ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເໝາະສົມຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດມັນ. ຖ້າທ່ານປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ເວັບໄຊ, "
"ຕົວທ່ອງເວັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງທ່ານຈະເປີດໜ້ານັ້ນ. ໃຫ້ໃສ່ https:// ໜ້າທີ່ຢູ່ເວັບໄຊ ເຊັ່ນ https://mate-"
"desktop.org."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:53
msgid "To choose a command that you ran previously, click the down arrow button beside the command field, then choose the command to run."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເລືອກຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານເຄີຍເອີ້ນໃຊ້ມາກ່ອນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມລູກສອນລົງຂ້າງຊ່ອງຄຳສັ່ງ, ແລ້ວເລືອກຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:57
msgid "You can also use the <guibutton>Run with file</guibutton> button to choose a file to append to the command line. For example, you can enter <application>emacs</application> as the command, then choose a file to edit."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌</guibutton> ເພື່ອເລືອກໄຟລ໌ມາຕໍ່ທ້າຍບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ. ຕົ"
"ວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດປ້ອນ <application>emacs</application> ເປັນຄຳສັ່ງ, ແລ້ວເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄ"
"ຂ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:62
msgid "Select the <guilabel>Run in terminal</guilabel> option to run the application or command in a terminal window. Choose this option for an application or command that does not create a window in which to run."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ <guilabel>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນເທີມີນໍ</guilabel> ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ຄຳສັ່ງໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເ"
"ທີມີນໍ. ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ມີປ່ອງຢ້ຽມສະແດງຜົນເອງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/gostools.xml:67
msgid "Click on the <guibutton>Run</guibutton> button on the <guilabel>Run Application</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້</guibutton> ໃນກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບ <guilabel>ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ</"
"guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gostools.xml:72
