#. (itstool) path: appendix/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:9
msgid "This section contains information on reporting bugs in MATE, making suggestions and comments about MATE applications or documentation, and ways in which you can help MATE."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (ບັກ) ໃນ MATE, ການໃຫ້ຂໍ້ສະເໜີແນະ ແລະ ຄຳຄິດເຫັນກ່ຽ"
"ວກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຫຼື ເອກະສານຂອງ MATE, ລວມທັງວິທີຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ MATE ໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:11
msgid "Reporting Bugs"
msgstr "ການລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (ບັກ)"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:13
msgid "If you have found a bug in a MATE application, please report it! Developers do read all the bug reports and try to fix these bugs. Please try to be as specific as possible when describing the circumstances under which the bug shows (What commands did you enter? Which buttons did you click?). If there were any error messages, be sure to include them, too."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (ບັກ) ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ MATE, ກະລຸນາລາຍງານໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຊາບ! ຜູ້ພັດທະນາຈະອ່ານທຸກກ"
"ານລາຍງານ ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມແກ້ໄຂພວກມັນ. ກະລຸນາໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະອຽດທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເຮັດໄດ້ ເມື່ອອະທິບາຍເຖິງສະຖ"
"ານະການທີ່ພົບບັກ (ທ່ານໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງໃດ? ທ່ານຄລິກປຸ່ມໃດ?). ຫາກມີຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃດໆ ປາກົດຂຶ້ນ, ກະລຸນາ"
"ແນບຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນມານຳ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:22
msgid "The easiest way to report bugs is by connecting to the <link xlink:href=\"https://github.com/mate-desktop/\">MATE bug tracking database</link>, where you can also browse the list of known bugs. You will need to register before you can submit any bugs this way."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການລາຍງານບັກແມ່ນການເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ <link xlink:href=\"https://github.com/"
"mate-desktop/\">ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຕິດຕາມບັກຂອງ MATE</link>, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ບັກທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້. ທ່"
"ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນກ່ອນຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດສົ່ງລາຍງານບັກຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:27
msgid "Please note that some of MATE applications are developed outside of MATE, or by commercial companies (these products are still free software). For example, <application>blueman</application>, a bluetooth application, is developed at <link xlink:href=\"https://github.com/blueman-project/blueman/\">GitHub</link>. Bug reports and comments about these products should be directed to the respective organization or company."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ບາງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງ MATE ແມ່ນຖືກພັດທະນາໂດຍກຸ່ມອື່ນນອກເໜືອຈາກ MATE ຫຼື ໂດຍບໍລິສັດເອກະຊົ"
"ນ (ແຕ່ຜະລິດຕະພັນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຍັງຄົງເປັນຊອບແວຟຣີ). ຕົວຢ່າງ: <application>blueman</application> "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນບລູທູດ ແມ່ນຖືກພັດທະນາຢູ່ທີ່ <link xlink:href=\"https://github.com/"
"blueman-project/blueman/\">GitHub</link>. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການລາຍງານບັກ ແລະ ຄຳຄິດເຫັນກ່ຽວກັບຜ"
"ະລິດຕະພັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ຄວນສົ່ງໄປຫາອົງກອນ ຫຼື ບໍລິສັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍກົງ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:38
msgid "Suggestions and Comments"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ສະເໜີແນະ ແລະ ຄຳຄິດເຫັນ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:40
msgid "If you have a suggestion or want to request a new feature for one of the applications, it can also be done using the bug tracking database. Submit your suggestion as a bug report as described in <xref linkend=\"feedback-bugs\"/> and at the appropriate step select <guilabel>Severity: Enhancement</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານມີຂໍ້ສະເໜີແນະ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການຂໍຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານຖານຂໍ້ມູນຕິດຕາມບັກ"
"ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຂໍ້ສະເໜີແນະຂອງທ່ານໃນຮູບແບບຂອງການລາຍງານບັກ ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ <xref "
"linkend=\"feedback-bugs\"/> ແລະ ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <guilabel>Severity: "
"Enhancement</guilabel> (ລະດັບຄວາມຮຸນແຮງ: ການປັບປຸງ)."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:49
msgid "Documentation Comments"
msgstr "ຄຳຄິດເຫັນກ່ຽວກັບເອກະສານ"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:51
msgid "If you found an inaccuracy or misprint in one of MATE documents, or have any comments or suggestions about documentation, please let us know! The easiest way of doing so is by submitting a bug report as explained before and selecting <guilabel>Component: docs</guilabel> at appropriate steps (or <guilabel>general</guilabel> if there is no <guilabel>docs</guilabel> component). If your comment is about general MATE documentation (such as <citetitle>MATE Users Guide</citetitle>) rather than specific application manual, select <guilabel>Product: mate-user-docs</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານພົບຈຸດທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ຄຳຜິດໃນເອກະສານຂອງ MATE, ຫຼື ມີຄຳຄິດເຫັນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ສະເໜີແນະກ່ຽວກັບເອກະສາ"
"ນ, ກະລຸນາແຈ້ງໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຊາບ! ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດຄືການສົ່ງລາຍງານບັກຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄປກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ແລະ ເລືອກ "
"<guilabel>Component: docs</guilabel> ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (ຫຼື <guilabel>general</"
"guilabel> ຫາກບໍ່ມີສ່ວນປະກອບ <guilabel>docs</guilabel>). ຫາກຄຳຄິດເຫັນຂອງທ່ານກ່ຽວກັບເອກະ"
"ສານທົ່ວໄປຂອງ MATE (ເຊັ່ນ <citetitle>ຄູ່ມືຜູ້ໃຊ້ MATE</citetitle>) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຄູ່ມືຂອງແອັບພລິເຄ"
"ຊັນໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <guilabel>Product: mate-user-docs</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:62
msgid "Alternatively, you can just send your comments by email to the <link xlink:href=\"http://ml.mate-desktop.org/listinfo\">MATE Documentation Project</link> mailing list."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳຄິດເຫັນຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານອີເມລໄປຫາ mailing list ຂອງ <link "
"xlink:href=\"http://ml.mate-desktop.org/listinfo\">ໂຄງການເອກະສານ MATE</link> "
"ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:70
msgid "Joining the MATE Project"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າຮ່ວມໂຄງການ MATE"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:71
msgid "We hope you enjoy using MATE and that you find working with MATE productive. However, there is always room for improvement."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຫວັງວ່າທ່ານຈະມີຄວາມສຸກໃນການໃຊ້ MATE ແລະ ເຫັນວ່າມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ວຽກງານຂອງທ່ານມີປະສິດທິພາບ. ເຖິ"
"ງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຍັງມີສິ່ງທີ່ສາມາດປັບປຸງໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນໄດ້ສະເໝີ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:72
msgid "MATE invites you to join our free software community if you have some spare time. There are many different fields. MATE needs programmers, but it also needs translators, documentation writers, testers, artists, writers, and more."
msgstr ""
"MATE ຂໍເຊີນທ່ານເຂົ້າຮ່ວມຊຸມຊົນຊອບແວຟຣີຂອງພວກເຮົາຫາກທ່ານມີເວລາຫວ່າງ. ພວກເຮົາມີຫຼາຍຂະແໜງການທີ່ຕ້ອງ"
"ການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ. MATE ຕ້ອງການນັກຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ, ແຕ່ກໍຍັງຕ້ອງການນັກແປ, ນັກຂຽນເອກະສານ, ຜູ້ທົດສອ"
"ບ, ນັກອອກແບບ, ນັກຂຽນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ອີກຫຼາຍ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:73
msgid "For more information on how you can get in touch with our community, please visit <link xlink:href=\"https://mate-desktop.org/community/\">https://mate-desktop.org/community/</link>."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຕິດຕໍ່ກັບຊຸມຊົນຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ກະລຸນາເຂົ້າເບິ່ງທີ່ <link "
"xlink:href=\"https://mate-desktop.org/community/\">https://mate-desktop.org/"
"community/</link>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:74
msgid "You are always welcome to make pull requests at our <link xlink:href=\"https://github.com/mate-desktop\">GitHub</link> repo."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງ pull requests ມາຫາພວກເຮົາໄດ້ສະເໝີທີ່ <link xlink:href=\"https://"
"github.com/mate-desktop\">GitHub</link> ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/gosfeedback.xml:75
msgid "For more information on giving feedback on MATE, such as bug reports, suggestions, and corrections to documentation, see <xref linkend=\"feedback-bugs\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຫ້ຄຳຄິດເຫັນຕໍ່ MATE ເຊັ່ນ: ການລາຍງານບັກ, ຂໍ້ສະເໜີແນະ ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂເອ"
"ກະສານ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງທີ່ <xref linkend=\"feedback-bugs\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/glossary.xml:6
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "ຄຳສັບ"

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:9
msgid "applet"
msgstr "ແອັບເປລັດ (applet)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:11
msgid "An applet is a small, interactive application that resides within a panel, for example the <application>Volume Control</application>. Each applet has a simple user interface that you can operate with the mouse or keyboard."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບເປລັດ ແມ່ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນພາເນລ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: "
"<application>Volume Control</application> (ຕົວຄວບຄຸມສຽງ). ແຕ່ລະແອັບເປລັດຈະມີສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້"
"ໃຊ້ທີ່ລຽບງ່າຍ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດສັ່ງການໄດ້ດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ຄີບອດ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:18
msgid "desktop"
msgstr "ເດັສທັອບ (desktop)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:20
msgid "The part of the MATE Desktop where there are no interface graphical items, such as panels and windows."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຂອງໜ້າຈໍ MATE ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສ່ວນປະກອບກຣາຟິກໃດໆ ປາກົດຢູ່ ເຊັ່ນ: ພາເນລ ແລະ ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:25
msgid "desktop background"
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງເດັສທັອບ"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:27
msgid "The image or color that is applied to your desktop."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ສີ ທີ່ນຳມາໃຊ້ສະແດງເປັນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງເດັສທັອບ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:31
msgid "desktop object"
msgstr "ວັດຖຸເທິງເດັສທັອບ (desktop object)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:33
msgid "An icon on your desktop that you can use to open your files, folders, and applications. You can use desktop objects to provide convenient access to files, folders, and applications that you use frequently."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນເທິງເດັສທັອບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດໄຟລ໌, ໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຕ່າງໆ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ວັດຖຸເທິງ"
"ເດັສທັອບເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ເປັນປະຈຳໄດ້ຢ່າງສະດວກ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:39
msgid "DNS name"
msgstr "ຊື່ DNS"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:41
msgid "A unique alphabetic identifier for a computer on a network."
msgstr "ຊື່ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບຸຕົວຕົນສະເພາະຂອງຄອມພິວເຕີໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:45
msgid "drawer"
msgstr "ລິ້ນຊັກ (drawer)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:47
msgid "A drawer is a sliding extension to a panel that you can open or close from a drawer icon."
msgstr ""
"ລິ້ນຊັກ ແມ່ນສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງພາເນລທີ່ສາມາດເລື່ອນອອກມາໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ໄອ"
"ຄອນລິ້ນຊັກ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:52
msgid "file extension"
msgstr "ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:54
msgid "The final portion of a file's name, after the last period (.) in the name. For example, the file extension of the file <filename>picture.jpeg</filename> is <filename>jpeg</filename>."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ທີ່ຢູ່ຖັດຈາກຈ້ຳ (.) ສຸດທ້າຍໃນຊື່. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ຂອງ <filename>"
"picture.jpeg</filename> ແມ່ນ <filename>jpeg</filename>."

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:55
msgid "The file extension can identify the type of file. <application>Caja</application> file manager uses this information when to determine what to do when you open a file. For more on this, see <xref linkend=\"caja-open-file\"/>."
msgstr ""
"ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ສາມາດບົ່ງບອກປະເພດຂອງໄຟລ໌ໄດ້. ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ <application>Caja</"
"application> ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ເພື່ອຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະເຮັດແນວໃດເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດໄຟລ໌. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງທີ່ "
"<xref linkend=\"caja-open-file\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:59
msgid "format"
msgstr "ຟໍແມັດ (format)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:61
msgid "To format media is to prepare the media for use with a particular file system. When you format media, you overwrite any existing information on the media."
msgstr ""
"ການຟໍແມັດສື່ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນ ແມ່ນການກຽມສື່ນັ້ນໃຫ້ພ້ອມສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຟໍແມັດ, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດໃ"
"ນສື່ນັ້ນຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:67
msgid "MATE-compliant application"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MATE"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:69
msgid "An application that uses the standard MATE programming libraries is called a MATE-compliant application. For example, <application>Caja</application> file manager and <application>pluma</application> text editor are MATE-compliant applications."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມມາດຕະຖານຂອງ MATE ແມ່ນເອີ້ນວ່າ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"MATE. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ໂປຣແກຣມຈັດການໄຟລ໌ <application>Caja</application> ແລະ ໂປຣແກຣມແກ້"
"ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ <application>pluma</application>."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:75
msgid "IP address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:77
msgid "A unique numeric identifier for a computer on a network."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກລະບຸຕົວຕົນສະເພາະຂອງຄອມພິວເຕີໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:81
msgid "keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:83
msgid "A <firstterm>keyboard shortcut</firstterm> is a key or combination of keys that provides an alternative to standard ways of performing an action."
msgstr ""
"<firstterm>ປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ</firstterm> ແມ່ນປຸ່ມ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມປຸ່ມກົດທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກໃນການສັ່ງການ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃ"
"ຊ້ວິທີມາດຕະຖານທົ່ວໄປ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:88
msgid "launcher"
msgstr "ຕົວເປີດ (launcher)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:90
msgid "A launcher starts a particular application, executes a command, or opens a file. A launcher can reside in a panel or in a menu."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເປີດ ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລີ່ມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ ຫຼື ເປີດໄຟລ໌. ຕົວເປີດສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນພາເນລ "
"ຫຼື ໃນເມນູໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:95
msgid "menubar"
msgstr "ແຖບເມນູ (menubar)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:97
msgid "A menubar is a bar at the top of an application window that contains the menus for the application."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບເມນູ ແມ່ນແຖບທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງສຸດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ເຊິ່ງລວມເອົາເມນູຕ່າງໆ ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນັ້ນໄວ້ນຳ"
"ກັນ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:102
msgid "MIME type"
msgstr "ປະເພດ MIME"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:104
msgid "A Multipurpose Internet Mail Extension (MIME) type identifies the format of a file. The MIME type enables applications to read the file. For example, an email application can use the <literal>image/png</literal> MIME type to detect that a Portable Networks Graphic (PNG) file is attached to an email."
msgstr ""
"MIME type ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບຸຮູບແບບຂອງໄຟລ໌ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສາມາດອ່ານໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ແອັບ"
"ພລິເຄຊັນອີເມລສາມາດໃຊ້ MIME type <literal>image/png</literal> ເພື່ອກວດຫາວ່າໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແນບມານັ້"
"ນແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ PNG."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:112
msgid "mount"
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ (mount)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:114
msgid "To mount is to make a file system available for access. When you mount a file system, the file system is attached as a subdirectory to your file system."
msgstr ""
"ການເມົາທ໌ ແມ່ນການເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ພ້ອມສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ. ເມື່ອທ່ານເມົາທ໌ລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ມັນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຂົ້າ"
"ເປັນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:120
msgid "pane"
msgstr "ສ່ວນ (pane)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:122
msgid "A pane is a subdivision of a window. For example, the <application>Caja</application> window contains a side pane and a view pane."
msgstr ""
"pane ແມ່ນສ່ວນຍ່ອຍຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ <application>Caja</application> ຈະປ"
"ະກອບດ້ວຍ ສ່ວນຂ້າງ (side pane) ແລະ ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ (view pane)."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:126
msgid "preference tool"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຕັ້ງຄ່າ (preference tool)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:128
msgid "A dedicated software tool that controls a particular part of the behavior of the MATE Desktop."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຊອບແວສະເພາະທີ່ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມພຶດຕິກຳສ່ວນໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງເດັສທັອບ MATE."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:133
msgid "shortcut keys"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດ"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:135
msgid "Shortcut keys are keystrokes that provide a quick way to perform an action."
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດ ແມ່ນການກົດປຸ່ມທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສັ່ງການຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:140
msgid "stacking order"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການຊ້ອນກັນ (stacking order)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:142
msgid "The stacking order is the order in which windows are stacked on top of each other on your screen."
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບການຊ້ອນກັນ ແມ່ນລຳດັບທີ່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຕ່າງໆ ວາງຊ້ອນກັນຢູ່ເທິງໜ້າຈໍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:147
msgid "statusbar"
msgstr "ແຖບສະຖານະ (statusbar)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:149
msgid "A statusbar is a bar at the bottom of a window that provides information about the current state of what you are viewing in the window."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບສະຖານະ ແມ່ນແຖບທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເບິ່ງຢູ່ໃນປ່"
"ອງຢ້ຽມນັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:154
msgid "symbolic link"
msgstr "ລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ (symbolic link)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:156
msgid "A special type of file that points to another file or folder. When you perform an action on a symbolic link, the action is performed on the file or folder to which the symbolic link points."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ປະເພດພິເສດທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີອື່ນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານສັ່ງການໃດໜຶ່ງໃສ່ລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ, ຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາໄ"
"ຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີທີ່ລິ້ງນັ້ນຊີ້ໄປ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:162
msgid "toolbar"
msgstr "ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື (toolbar)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:164
msgid "A toolbar is a bar that contains buttons for the most commonly-used commands in an application. Typically, a toolbar appears under a menubar."
msgstr ""
"ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື ແມ່ນແຖບທີ່ລວມເອົາປຸ່ມຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນປະຈຳໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຈະປາກົດຢູ່"
"ລຸ່ມແຖບເມນູ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:169
msgid "Uniform Resource Identifier"
msgstr "Uniform Resource Identifier (URI)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:171
msgid "A Uniform Resource Identifier (URI) is a string that identifies a particular location in a file system or on the Web. For example, the address of a web page is a URI."
msgstr ""
"URI ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ເທິງເວັບ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງໜ້າເວັບແມ່ນ URI."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:177
msgid "Uniform Resource Locator"
msgstr "Uniform Resource Locator (URL)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:179
msgid "A Uniform Resource Locator (URL) is the address of a particular location on the Web."
msgstr "URL ແມ່ນທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງເວັບ."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:184
msgid "view"
msgstr "ການສະແດງຜົນ (view)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:186
msgid "A <application>Caja</application> component that enables you to display a folder in a particular way. For example, <application>Caja</application> contains an icon view which enables you to display the contents of a folder as icons. <application>Caja</application> also contains a list view which enables you to display the contents of a folder as a list."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ <application>Caja</application> ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງໂຟນເດີໃ"
"ນຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: <application>Caja</application> ມີການສະແດງແບບໄອຄອນ "
"(icon view) ແລະ ແບບລາຍການ (list view)."

#. (itstool) path: glossentry/glossterm
#: C/glossary.xml:193
msgid "workspace"
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ (workspace)"

#. (itstool) path: glossdef/para
#: C/glossary.xml:195
msgid "A workspace is a discrete area in the MATE Desktop in which you can work."
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ ແມ່ນພື້ນທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນເດັສທັອບ MATE ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."
